<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Ayu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ayubu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Ayubu</para>
  <para style="mt1">AYUBU</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu cha Ayubu chotusimulila imunu yumwe yana ihaki iyakemighwe Ayubu. Ayubu tsakaghanzika ng'ani, lekeni ng'atendile nzambi kwa kumlaumu Imulungu baye. Kuduhu munu iyamanyile nani iyandike ichitabu, au tsuwachi ichitabu achino hachandikighwe. Iwanu iwasomile ng'awotoghola baye ka Ayubu mwenyegho yuyo iyandike ichitabu, lekeni wawo wotoghola ka munu yungi yang'amanyike kona pfinogha kutsandika simulitsi tsa Ayubu, kwaapfila yeye Ayubu kakala mgima mna ghamatsuwa ghawakalile wagima tsina Abrahamu. Yeye Ayubu tsakapfika miyaka miya na alubaini.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu chotulongela Ayubu pfayaghanzike, chakwanza kwa kutulongela shetani pfayalekelighwe yamdununze Ayubu kwaapfila shetani tsakamanya ka chinu achino ching'amhonzile Ayubu yaleke kumtambikila Imulungu (Ayubu 1.11). Chitabu chose ghendo chotusimulila apfila Ayubu pfayang'ali yolonga na sale tsake wadatu, tsakawalongela hebali yeye yang'ali yoghaya. Sale tsake tsawatoghola ghendo ka Ayubu yang'ali yoghaya kwaapfila tsakatenda nzambi, lekeni yeye Ayubu kalema, kalonga ng'atendile totso baye. Kuya Imulungu kalonga na Ayubu, lekeni ng'amlongele baye heule tsakaghaya apfo pfihile. Ahala Ayubu hayatangile ka Imulungu kodaha kutenda chochose chayobama, na imunu ng'odaha baye kumanya ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa pfayotenda Imulungu, baho Imulungu kambaliki keli, kamwing'a pfinu pfingi na wana wangi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mna ichitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Aghala ighamtendile Ayubu yaghaye, ighalawile kwa Satani, gholawa mna Isula ya 1 na 2.</para>
  <para style="io">Ayubu na sale tsake pfawang'ali wolonga, wang'ali wolonga ukughaya kwa Ayubu. Isula 3 mbaka ya 37.</para>
  <para style="io">Imulungu kolonga na Ayubu kakwidika Isula 42.7-17 yotulongela apfila pfayamalitse ugima wake na apfila pfayaghendelele kumbaliki keli. Mna isula ya 38 mbaka 42.6.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="s">Shetani komghetsa Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />Tsakuna munu yumwe mna isi ya Usi, iyakemighwe Ayubu. Imunu ayo tsakahela matotso na tsakanogha, yeye tsakampfuka Imulungu na yang'ali yohepa ukutenda ighehile. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" />Ayubu tsakana wana wamale saba na wana wadatu mapinga. <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />Tsakana ng'olo elufu saba, ngamiya elufu ndatu, ng'ombe wa ukulimila elufu imwe, na pfihongwe mapinga miya tano, pfipfila tsakana watumwa wengi. Apfo imunu ayo tsakana mali nyingi kubita wanu wose iwakalile mashaliki. <verse eid="JOB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />Na iwanaghe wang'ali woghendagha wakaje na ukunwa mna ing'anda ya ndughu yawo yumwe, na chila ndughu kwa tsuwa lyake. Na wang'ali wowakemagha lumbu tsawo wadatu watse waje na wanwe hamwe nawo. <verse eid="JOB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />Na hawomalitsa ukutenda apfo, Ayubu yang'ali yowakemagha iwanaghe watse yawatende wele, naye kolamka lupfilipfili, kolapfa nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa kwa chila mwanaghe, aku yang'ali yolongagha, songaha wanangu watenda nzambi na wamligha Imulungu mna imimoyo yawo. Apfino pfipfo pfayang'ali yotendagha Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />Tsuwa limwe malaika wa Imulungu wetingana hamwe hambele ha IMNDEWA, naye Shetani tsakaghenda baho. <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" />IMNDEWA kamghutsa Shetani, “Kwaulawile kuhi ghweghwe?” Shetani kamwidika IMNDEWA, “Nene ndawa kwanga kwanga na kutsunguluka tsunguluka muisi.” <verse eid="JOB 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Shetani, “Pfihi kumwona mtumighwa wangu Ayubu? Haduhu munu yungi iyali ka yeye mna isi yose. Yeye ka munu iyalihela nzambi na kanogha na kompfuka Imulungu, naye kohepa ukutenda Ighehile.” <verse eid="JOB 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />Baho Shetani kamwidika IMNDEWA, “Angu Ayubu kompfuka hela Imulungu? <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />Angu si ghweghwe baye yumkingile yeye na ing'anda yake, na pfinu pfose pfayali napfo? Ghweghwe kutsibaliki tsing'onde tsa ghamoko ghake, apfo wang'olo na wamene na wanyama wangi wenela muisi mwose. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" />Lekeni sambi usole pfinu pfose pfayali napfo, naye katsokuligha aku ghweghwe kolola.”<verse eid="JOB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />Imulungu kamlongela Shetani, “Pfinogha, kodaha kutenda chochose mna chila chinu chayali nacho, lekeni yeye imwenyegho uleke kumlagha.” Apfo Shetani koka hambele ha IMNDEWA.<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwana wa Ayubu wokomighwa na tsimali tsohinyighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Tsuwa limwe, iwana wa Ayubu iwamale na iwapinga hawang'ali wakuja na kunwa dipfai mna ing'anda ya imbala wao, <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />mtumighwa yumwe kamtsumila Ayubu, kamlongela, “Tung'ali tulima na wang'ombe, na wapfihongwe wang'ali wakuja habehi nawo. <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />Baho wanu wa Seba watupfingila, wawasola iwanyama na iwatumighwa wawakoma kwa lipanga. Nene niliyeka yuyo yanihonile nitse nikulongele.” <verse eid="JOB 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />Ng'ana yamalitse ukulonga agho, munu yungi katsa kamlongela Ayubu, “Ilumwesa luwalakatsa iwang'olo na iwatumighwa wako, nene niliyeka yuyo yanihonile nitse nikulongele.” <verse eid="JOB 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />Ayo naye ng'ana yamalitse ukulonga, munu yungi naye katsa kamlongela Ayubu, “Wakalidayo wakala makingili madatu, wawapfingilila wangamia, wawasola na wawakoma iwatumighwa wako kwa lipanga, nene niliyeka yuyo yanihonile nitse nikulongele.” <verse eid="JOB 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />Ayo naye ng'ana yamalitse ukulonga agho, munu yungi katsa kamlongela Ayubu, “Iwanagho wamale na mapinga wang'ali wakuja na kunwa mna ing'anda ya mbala wao, <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />baho inyahemu iduma kulawa kunyika, na iitowa ing'anda chila ubali, nayo ing'anda iwaghwila, na iwanagho wose wafa, nene niliyeka yuyo yanihonile nitse nikulongele.” <verse eid="JOB 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />Kuya Ayubu kema wima, kadegha ghamagwanda ghake, kabeya tsimvili tsake kamwinamila Imulungu mbaka uhanga wake udonza hasi. <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />Baho kalonga, “Nene nyelekighwa kulawa munda mwa mai wangu nachidako, na nitsakuka nachidako, IMNDEWA kalapfa na IMNDEWA kasola, taghwa lyake linulighwe.” <verse eid="JOB 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />Mna agho ghose Ayubu ng'atendile nzambi baye, wala ng'apfikitse baye ka ghayatendile Imulungu gheha.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="s">Shetani komghetsa keli Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />Tsuwa lingi malaika wa IMNDEWA wetingana hamwe hambele ha IMNDEWA, naye Shetani kaghenda baho. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />IMNDEWA kamghutsa Shetani, “Kwaulawile kuhi ghweghwe?” Shetani kamwidika, “Nene ndawa kwanga kwanga na kutsunguluka tsunguluka muisi.” <verse eid="JOB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Shetani, “Pfihi imtumighwa wangu Ayubu kumwona? Haduhu munu iyali ka yeye mna isi yose. Yeye ka imunu iyalihela nzambi na kanogha na kompfuka IMNDEWA, kohepa ukutenda ighehile. Naye mbaka sambi kapfipfo, hata ka ghweghwe tsakunisongeletsa nimkome hela.” <verse eid="JOB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Shetani kamwidika IMNDEWA, “Immale katsolulolesa lukuli lwake matsuwa ghose, katsolapfa pfose pfayali napfo ili yawe mgima. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />Lekeni sambi ugholose ghumoko ghwako ulaghe ilukuli lwake na imipate yake, naye katsokuligha aku ghweghwe ghumwenyegho kolola.” <verse eid="JOB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Shetani “Pfinogha, kodaha kumtendela pfaubama, lekeni uleke kumkoma.”<verse eid="JOB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />Baho Shetani koka hambele ha IMNDEWA, kamdununza Ayubu kwa kumwing'a mapute kulawa mwitsayo mbaka mwitwi. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />Ayubu kasola chihali ketsaghila, na kaghenda kukala mna lipfu. <verse eid="JOB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />Baho imwehe wake kamlongela, “Pfihi ung'ali komtoghola Imulungu? Mlighe Imulungu ufe.” <verse eid="JOB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />Ayubu kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kolonga ka kwa pinga mbotsi! Pfihi tubokeleghe ghanoghile ghaliyeka kulawa kwa Imulungu, na si ighehile baye?” Mna ghose agho Ayubu ng'atendile nzambi baye kwa ghumlomo ghwake.<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sale wadatu wa Ayubu womwangila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />Lelo sale wadatu wa Ayubu, Elifazi iyolawa Temani, Bilidadi iyolawa Shua, na Sofari iyolawa Naamati, hawahulike maghayo ghampatile Ayubu, chila yumwe kalawa ukaye yake, wetingana hamwe, waghenda kumlola na kumkanza. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />Hawamwonile kwa kutali, ng'awadahile baye ukumtanga. Apfo wangula chililo, wadegha ghamabwende ghawo, wayesila litimbwisi mwitwi mwao. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" />Wakala naye hasi mtimbwisi kwa matsuwa saba, chilo na misi, kuduhu yumwe iyalongile naye, kwaapfila tsawona apfila pfayang'ali yoghaya ng'ani.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kolongeleka kwa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1" />Baho Ayubu kanza ukulonga, aku kolighita litsuwa lyayoneke.<verse eid="JOB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2" />Naye Ayubu kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />“Iilighitighwe litsuwa alila lyanyoneke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:3">na ichilo achila hailongighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:3">‘Inda ya mwana mmale ikindighwa.’<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />Litsuwa alyo likale na chisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">Imulungu iyali kulanga yaleke kulilola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">wala ghumwanga ghuleke kulangatsa,<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />likale na chisi, na chisi chikulu totolo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">bingu kulu lilighubike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">na chisi cha nemisi chilighume wogha.<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />Kuya ichilo acho chiwe na chisi chikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">chileke kupetighwa mna ghamatsuwa gha ghumwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">wala chileke kwingitsighwa mna ukupetighwa imiyetsi.<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />Ona, ichilo acho chileke kuwa na pinga iyokinda inda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:7">chiseko cha ukudeng'elela chileke kuhulikika.<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />Iwanu iwolighita ghamatsuwa, nawo walilighite litsuwa alyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:8">na awala iwamanyile kulilamsa litsoka likemighwa Lewiyatani walihinye litsuwa alyo.<verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />Tsinondo tsake tsa lupfilipfili tsiwe chisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">itsibama kupata ghumwanga lekeni ng'aghulawila baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">wala tsileke kona miyale ya litsuwa lya nemitondo,<verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />kwaapfila ichilo acho ng'achihindile baye inda ya mai wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:10">chindeka nene nyoneke, mbone ghamaghayo aghano ghose.<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />Heule sifile baye haning'ali na munda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:11">na hebali sihupile baye bahala ghendo handawile munda?<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />Heule wenye wangu yanyeleke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:12">hebali nyong'ile ghamatombo ghake?<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />Kwaapfila aho ning'atsikighwe na kukala tulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:13">ning'awasile na kubwihila,<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />hamwe na wafalume na iwakulu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:14">iwatsengile keli tsing'anda tsinoghile itsikalile mahame.<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />Ning'akalile hamwe na iwakulu wana tsinzahabu, na iwamemetse tsifetsa tsing'anda tsawo,<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />au ning'atsikighwe ka imwana yafilile munda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:16">ka imwana iyoneke sambi, na ng'ana yone litsuwa baye.<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />Ako iwehile woleka kuwadepfetsa iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:17">na iwepfile wobwihila.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />Ako hata iwohighwe wobweda hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:18">ng'awohulika baye imkulu wao iyowemilila pfayowamanila.<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Ako iwakulu na wadowado wakuko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:19">na iwatumwa walekelelighwa kulawa kwa iwatwatsa wao.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />Heule imunu iyali mmaghayo yeng'ighwe ghumwanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:20">Na wana usungu mna ghumoyo weng'ighwe ugima,<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />iwobetetsa ukufa, lekeni ng'awakufa baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:21">iwobama ukufa kubita apfila imunu pfayobama ihatsina ipfisike,<verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />angu iwanu ka awo ng'awatsodeng'elela baye na kubigha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:22">hawatsolyona likabuli?<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />Heule imunu iyana inzila ipfisike yeng'ighwe ghumwanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:23">ayula Imulungu iyamwikile ubanda umtsunguluke?<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />Kwaapfila ukughutilila chicho ichijo changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:24">na ghamasotsi ghangu koghidika ka matsi,<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />kwaapfila ichinu achila chanipfuka chicho ichinitsila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:25">achila ichingaya wogha chicho ichindawila.<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />Sikona ng'apfu baye, wala sikala tulu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:26">wala sibwihila baye, lekeni maghayo ghaliyeka ighonitsila.”<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="s">Elifazi kakwandusa kulonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Baho Elifazi, imunu iyolawa Temani, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />“Angu kutsakona pfiha imunu yang'abama ukulonga na ghweghwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:2">Lekeni nani iyodaha kwinyamala yaleke ukulonga?<verse eid="JOB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />Lola, ghweghwe kuwafunda wanu wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:3">kuweng'a ingupfu iwanu iwalio nyonde nyonde.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />Ghamalonga ghako ghawenula awala iwang'ali wakughwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:4">na ghawatenda awala ing'awodaha ukwima weme.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Lekeni sambi ghakulawila ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:5">naghwe ng'ughadudumila baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:5">ghakupata, naghwe kutenyuka ghendo ghumoyo.<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />Ng'ambe ukumpfuka Imulungu kuko ukwihuwila kwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:6">na ukukala kwako bila nzambi lyilo lolelo lyako?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />Lelo ukumbuke, nani iyakomighwe aku kahela totso?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:7">Na iwanu iwalihela nzambi kwani kwawakomighwe?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />Pfanimanya nene, iwolima ghehile na iwohanda maghayo wopfuna ghagho.<verse eid="JOB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />Imulungu kowakoma kwa imuhe yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:9">wohupa ahala imaya yake haiduma.<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />Isimba kodaha kuduma na kukoloma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:10">Lekeni matsino ghake isimba ayo mkulu ghobenighwa.<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />Isimba iyalalile kakufa ka kahela imnyama wa kumghogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:11">na iwana wa simba pinga wopwililika.<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />Imbuli initsila chinyelenyele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:12">ghutwi lyangu lihulika apfila pfayang'ali yodong'onda,<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />initsila nechilo iwanu hawolota tsindoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:13">na hawowasa tsinongo ndito.<verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />Wogha unyingila, na ukughudema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:14">utenda mipate yangu yose ighudeme.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />Beho libita hambele ha ichihanga changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:15">na tsimvili tsa ilukuli lwangu lwose tsiyayamka.<verse eid="JOB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />Libeho alyo lima tulu, lekeni handolile, silitangile baye lili pfihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">wala sonile umbo baye hambele hangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">lekeni kukala toyoyo, kuya nihulika litsi lilonga,<verse eid="JOB 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />‘Pfihi imunu kodaha koneka kana ihaki kubita Imulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:17">Pfihi imunu kodala koneka kela kubita Maumba wake?<verse eid="JOB 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />Hata iwatumighwa wake ngawotogheleka baye hambele hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:18">Hata wamalaika wake kowona ka watotsa.<verse eid="JOB 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />Lelo pfihi kwa awala iwokala mna tsing'anda tsa lidongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">wana ghumsingi ghwikighwe mtimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">iwodaha kudughighwa ka sondo.<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />Iwanu wakuwa wagima nemitondo, haipfika nemihe wakufa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:20">na wohupa kwa matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa, na kuduhu imunu iyakwalangula.<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />Ghose ghayali nagho ghatsosolighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:21">naye kakufa aku kahela ihekima?’”<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />Lelo ukeme ka kuna munu iyokwidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:1">na malaika wachi yutsomhundukila?<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />Kwaapfila lifondogholo lyomkoma imunu mbotsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:2">ukona gele komkoma imunu iyalihela mbutsi.<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />Nene nimwona munu mbotsi kebweda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:3">lekeni baho niilighita ing'anda yake.<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />Iwana wake ng'awakona ugima baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">wobunzighwa kuna libalatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">kwaapfila kuduhu munu iyowalongelela.<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />Iwanu wana inzala wakuja ipfijo pfayapfunile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">na wosola hata apfila ipfotile mna imihonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">na iwanu watsodo wosulukila tsimali tsawo,<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />kwaapfila ghamaghayo ng'agholawa mna litimbwisi baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:6">wala ukughanzika ng'akulawa mna lidongo baye.<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />Lekeni imunu kakwelekighwa yaghaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:7">ka tsisesi tsa ghumoto pfatsighuluka kuchanya.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />Lekeni nene ning'awile ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:8">ning'ambamile Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:8">ning'amghalile yeye lighomba lyangu.<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />Yeye iyotenda ighali makulu, ing'aghotangika baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:9">na iyotenda pfinu pfa ukukangawatsa, napfo ng'apfipeteka baye.<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />Iyolekelela imvula itowe muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:10">na iyoghala ghamatsi mna imighunda.<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />Iyowenula mchanya awala iwehulumsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:11">na awala iwodomboketsa kowenula wakale akula kuli na ugima.<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />Kopfulaghitsa imitsengwe ya iwanu waghutsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:12">ili waleke kutenda aghala ghawobama.<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />Yeye iyowonza awala iwakengele mna ukubugha kwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:13">na ghawobama kutenda awo iwobugha iwanu, yeye koghatenda ghatsighe himahima.<verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />Nemisi wao wetingana na ichisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:14">na wobamasa bamasa nemisi ka nechilo.<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Lekeni yeye kowakombola iwahingwa waleke ukukomighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:15">kowaswekula kulawa mna ghamoko gha wana tsingupfu.<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />Apfo wahingwa wana cha ukulolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:16">na ighehile ghotsigha.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />Lola! Kabweda imunu iyotowighwa na Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:17">Apfo uleke kubetsa ukutowighwa na Imulungu yana ingupfu.<verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />Kwaapfila yeye kolagha, lekeni pfipfila kohonetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:18">yeye komwing'a imunu pfilonda, na kwa ghamoko ghake kohonetsa.<verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />Katsokukombola mna maghayo sita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:19">hata ghang'awa saba, ng'akutsakuwa na chinu chihile ichitsokupata.<verse eid="JOB 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />Mna ghumsimu ghwa inzala yeye katsokukombola uleke kufa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:20">na hawitowa kuna ing'ondo yeye katsokukombola uleke kukomighwa na lipanga.<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />Katsokukinga ahala imilimi ya iwanu haikulonga pfihile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:21">naghwe ng'utsopfuka baye ahala ukukomighwa hakukutsa.<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />Ukughanzika na inzala hapfikutsa, ghweghwe kutsoseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:22">wala ng'utsowapfuka baye iwanyama wakali iwali muisi.<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />Kwaapfila ghamabwe ighali kumighunda ng'aghatsokughoma baye ulime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:23">na wanyama wa kubagho ng'awatsokuluma baye.<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />Naghwe kutsomanya ka ing'anda yako ikala ghoya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:24">hautsowakaghula iwanyama wako, kutsowona wose wabaho.<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />Naghwe kutsomanya ghendo ka iwatsukulu wako watsakuwa wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:25">na ipfeleko pfako pfitsakuwa pfingi ka mitsani ili muisi.<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />Kutsopfika kwikabuli aku kuna miyaka itimile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:26">ka chikungwi cha ingano ichipfile mna ghumsimu ghwake.<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />Apfo aghano ghagho ghatughakaghule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:27">nagho gholongesa ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:27">ghahulike, kwaapfila ghatsokwapfila.<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu komwidika Elifasi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Kuya Ayubu kedika, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />“Ka usungu wangu ung'alingighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:2">na maghayo ghangu ghang'alingighwe hamwe,<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />ghang'awile matsito kubita msanga ghwa kumwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:3">apfo tsimbuli tsanilonga nolonga bila ukufikitsa.<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />Kwaapfila imigoha ya Imulungu yana ingupfu inihoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">na iloho yangu inwa isumu yake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">ipfinu pfa ukupfuka pfayanendele Imulungu pfingaya wogha.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Angu chihongwe wa kubagho kolila aku kakuja mitsani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:5">Au ing'ombe kolila kuna ghumghina?<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Angu ichijo chakujighwa bila ghumkele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:6">Na pfihi uto wa lifinga una mta ghwachi?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />Nene nolema ghendo hata ukupfilanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:7">kuna nene nopfona ka pfijo ipfidesa.<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />Ng'apfu Imulungu yang'anyidike chanimlombile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:8">na yang'angayile chanilolela,<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />yang'onile pfinogha kunihondahonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:9">na kugholosa ghumoko ghwake ghunikome.<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />Acho ching'awile chinu cha ukunikanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">ning'adalukedaluke kwa kudeng'elela hata ka nina usungu mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">kwaapfila silemile baye ukukinda tsimbuli tsa Imulungu iyelile.<verse eid="JOB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />Nina ngupfu yachi nene ya ukughendelela kuwa mgima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:11">Na ukutsigha kwangu kutsakuwatse, mbaka nikalitse?<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />Pfihi nene nina ngupfu ka tsa mabwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:12">Au ilukuli lwangu ka lwa shaba?<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />Apfi nene nodaha kwiyapfila nimwenyegho?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:13">Apfi ukwapfilighwa ng'akuli kutali ghendo na nene baye?<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />Imunu iyali habehi na ukutsilika kobamighwa yatendelighwe uluso na sale yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:14">hata ka imunu ayo koleka ukumpfuka Imulungu yana ingupfu.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />Sale tsangu wangutsukila ka lukolongo lwa matsi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:15">wanibugha ka pfikolongo ipfimemile ghamatsi gha msimu,<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />ipfighubikighwe na ibalafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:16">ako iseluji ipfisa mghati mwake.<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />Kunze hakutsumbuka yolubuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:17">na litsuwa halikwalika ipfikolongo apfo pfonyala ghendo.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />Imisululo ya wachulutsi woleka nzila yawo woghenda wobama ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:18">woghenda kuchiwala, na kufila kuko.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />Misululo ya wachulutsi iwolawa Tema wobama ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:19">na imisululo ya wachulutsi iwolawa Sheba wololela ghamatsi agho.<verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />Watenyuka ghendo kwaapfila walolela hela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:20">na hawapfikile ako wakeng'eneka.<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />Mwemwe namwe pfipfo pfamli, ka ipfikolongo apfo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:21">mwoghona ghamaghayo ghangu, na mwopfuka.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />Pfihi tsanonga mngaye chinu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:22">Au mnilihe chinu kulawa mna tsimali tsenu?<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />Au mniswekule kulawa mna ghumoko ghwa ayula iyonyihila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:23">Au mniswekule kulawa mna ghumoko ghwa awala iwonidununza?<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />Nifundeni, na nene nitsenyamala tulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:24">nilanguseni alila lyanitotsile.<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Lola ghamalonga igholongesa pfaghotama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:25">lekeni ukughutsa ghutsa kwenu, kufunda choni?<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />Pfihi mwoghamba mwodaha kughabetsa ghamalonga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:26">Na kughatenda ghamalonga gha imunu iyalihela lolelo ghoneke ka beho?<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />Mwemwe mwomwasila simbi hata imchuwa yawe wenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:27">na mwomuutsa hata isale yenu muwe matajili.<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />Lekeni sambi mndole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:28">kwaapfila sitsomghutsukilani baye.<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Muye lelo, nowalomba, kuleke kulawila ghehile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:29">ona, muye, kwaapfila nene na imunu iyanoghile.<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Pfihi mna ilulimi lwangu mna mbuli ihile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:30">Au pfihi agho ghanilonga ng'aghodaha kulangusa ighehile baye.”<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />Angu imunu ng'alihela ng'onde ng'omu baye muisi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:1">Na matsuwa ghake ng'aghali ka matsuwa gha chibaluwa baye?<verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />Yeye ka mtumwa iyololela ng'ani kukala hachimbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:2">na ka imunu iyosang'ana pfayobetetsa kwing'ighwa tsisendi tsake.<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />Pfipfo nene nying'ighwa miyetsi ya maghayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:3">na nying'ighwa usungu chilo na chilo.<verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />Haniwasa nolonga, nitsolamka tsuwachi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">Kwaapfila chilo chitali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">nobilinduka bilinduka mlili mbaka kuche.<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />Lukuli lwangu lumema membele na chikwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:5">Ingotsi yangu yopfimba, na udusi wotumbuka.<verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />Matsuwa ghangu ghotsuma kubita chinu cha ukudadatsa ichidadatsa himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:6">nagho ghotsigha bila kuwa na chinu cha ukulolela.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />Ghwe Imulungu, ukumbuke, ugima wangu pfauli ka muhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:7">na tsinenge tsangu ng'atsitsakona keli ighanoghile baye.<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />Inenge indola sambi, ng'aitsombona keli baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:8">na baho tsinenge tsako hatsindola, nene sitsakuwa baho baye.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />Ka libingu pfalitoyoyoka na kuhupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:9">pfipfo kwa ayula iyoghenda kutsimu, ng'akuya keli baye.<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />Ng'akuya keli baye ukaye yake yakale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:10">na hanu hake hatsomsemwa ghendo.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />Apfo sitsenyamala baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">nitsolonga apfila ghumoyo ghwangu pfaghughaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">nitsololoma apfila ghumoyo ghwangu pfaghuli na usungu.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />Pfihi nene na ibahali, au nanyangumi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:12">mbaka unyikile iwanu wanikalitse?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />Hanilonga lunanda lwangu lutsonenda nibwihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:13">pfilagho pfangu pfitsonihungutsila ukughula kwangu,<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />ghweghwe konighela wogha kwa ndoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:14">konenda nipfuke kwa kungalila ghamaono.<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />Apfo nakona ng'apfu ninyonge nimwenyegho nife,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:15">kubita ukughaya apfino.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />Nakona pfiha kukala mgima, kwaapfla sikala baye matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:16">mndeke niliyeka, kwaapfila matsuwa ghangu si chinu baye.<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />Angu imunu yali chinu chachi, mbaka umloleghe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:17">na mbaka umwikeghe mmoyo?<verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />Na umwangileghe chila nemitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:18">na utseghe kumghetsa chila saa?<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />Angu utsoleka tsuwachi ukundola?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:19">Pfihi ng'undeka baye tanu nimetse ghamate?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />Ka nenda nzambi, pfihi nikutendele choni, ghweghwe yubetetsa iwanu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">Heule unitenda nene niwe chinu cha kulengela ukutowa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">Pfihi nene niwa mtsigho kuna ghweghwe?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />Heule ng'ulilekelela baye litotso lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">na ng'unileghusila baye ghamatotso ghangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">Na sambi nene nowasa hasi mtimbwisi nohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">kutsonibama, lekeni ng'utsombona baye.<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="s">Bilidadi komwidika Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Baho Bilidadi, kulawa Shuhi kamwidika Ayubu,<verse eid="JOB 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />“Kutsolonga tsimbuli atsino mbaka tsuwachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:2">na mbaka tsuwachi mbuli itsilawa mna ghumlomo ghwako tsitsakuwa mbewe ka beho?<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />Angu Imulungu ng'ohigha ghoya baye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:3">Au Imulungu yana ingupfu kopfulaghitsa ighali gha haki.<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />Ka iwanagho wamtendela nzambi Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:4">naye kawaliha kwa kulola achila chawamtendele,<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />ka kwitseyunda ukumbama Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:5">na ung'amdedetsa Imulungu yana ingupfu,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />na ka kwinagho ghumoyo ighwelile na ighugholoke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">nolongesa ghendo Imulungu katsakutsa yakwapfile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">na kokuyitsila ikaye yako, na ghose ighanoghile ighakalile ghako.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />Hata ka tsakwanza na pfinu chidogho</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:7">matsuwa ghako ighakutsa kutsakuwa na pfinu bwelele.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />Apfo waghutse iwanu iwakalile baho ghumwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:8">Ghalole aghala ghawonile sekulu tsawo.<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />Kwaapfila twetwe twoneka jutsi jutsi hela, ng'atumanya chinu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:9">apfo matsuwa ghetu ahano muisi ka chimbeho ichipfosa.<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />Angu awo ng'awatsokufunda baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:10">na kukulongela aghala igholawa mna ukumanya kwao?<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />Pfihi tsinemvu tsodaha kota hanu halihela chitsapfa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:11">Na imidete yadaha kukula hanu halihela ghamatsi?<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />Aku yoghendelela kukula, na ng'ana iwanu waigane baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:12">yosumka kuholola kubita mitsani ingi ka hasi hang'akangaluka.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />Apfi pfipfo pfawatsotsigha awala iwomsemwa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:13">na ukulolela kwa ayula ing'ayammanyile Imulungu kohupa.<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />Achila chayehuwila chitsobeneka beneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:14">na ukulolela kwake kwakuwa ka utandabuwi.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />Kakwaghamila utando wake, lekeni ng'aukwima baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:15">kounanahila, lekeni ng'aukala baye.<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />Kakuwa ka mbiki mbisi hambele ha lutsuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:16">ghwakwenetsa maputila ghake mlukonde mwose.<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />Mitsitsi yake yebenyetsa benyetsa mna sughulu ya ghamabwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:17">na yonanahila kuna ghamabambalawe.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />Lekeni ghung'abulighwa kulawa hanu hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:18">hanu aho hatsolonga, ‘Nene sikonile baye.’<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />Lola, ugima wake wohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:19">na hanu hake hatsakota mibiki ingi.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />Lola Imulungu ng'atsomlema baye imunu iyalihela matotso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:20">wala ng'atsowapfila baye iwanu wehile.<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />Ila ghumlomo ghwako katsoghumemetsa chiseko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:21">na ilulimi lwako lutsodeng'elela.<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />Awala iwokwihila watsakona chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:22">na hanu hawokala iwehile hatsohupa ghendo.”<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />Kuya ayubu kawedika, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />Nomanya ghendo ka apfi pfipfo pfaili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:2">lekeni imunu yodahatse kuwa na haki hambele ha Imulungu?<verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />Ka imunu kobama kuhila naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:3">ng'odaha baye kumwidika mbuli imwe mna mbuli elufu imwe.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />Yeye kana hekima mmoyo na kana ngupfu nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:4">nani iyampingile na kumhuma?<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />Yeye iyobula imidunda, bila yenyegho kutanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:5">na koibindulila kutali kwa imaya yake.<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />Yeye iyoihighisa isi kulawa hanu hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:6">na iyotsitenda tsingutso tsake tsighudeme.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />Yeye kolilaghitsa litsuwa lileke kulawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:7">kotsidiwa tsinondo tsileke kulangatsa.<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />Yeye yaliyeka iyotsitandatsa tsilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:8">na kughabajugha ghamawimbi gha ibahali.<verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />Yeye iyaumbile tsinondo tsa Dubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:9">na Orioni na chilimila na mabughulu gha tsinondo tsa kusini.<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />Yeye iyotenda ighali makulu ing'aghomanyika baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:10">na gha kukangawatsa, ing'aghopeteka baye.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />Ulole! Yeye kobita habehi yangu, lekeni simwona baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:11">na kakuka aku nene simtambula baye.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />Lola, Yeye yang'asola chinu, nani wa kumghoma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">Nani yatsomghutsa, “Utenda choni?”<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />Imulungu ng'oighoma baye imaya yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:13">hata awala iwomwapfila Rahabu, liboka lya ibahali, wokung'unyala hambele hake.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />Lelo nidahatse kumwidika Imulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:14">Angu nighasaghula kwani malonga gha ukulonga naye?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />Hata ka nahela totso, nene sidaha baye kumwidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:15">nobamighwa nimlombe mlamtsi wangu iyonihigha yambonele libatsi.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Hata ka ning'amkemile, naye yanyidike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:16">tsasidaha baye kutoghola ka kanitegheletsa.<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />Yeye iyonitowa kwa inyahemu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:17">na konyongetsela hela ipfilonda pfangu.<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />Ng'ondeka ghendo baye nihumle,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:18">lekeni yeye konyongetsa usungu.<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />Tung'alola tsingupfu, yeye kana ngupfu sideke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:19">na kwa imbuli ya ihaki, nani iyatsomghala kwibalatsa?<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />Hata ka nene nina haki, chanilongile kwa mlomo ghwangu ching'anihighile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:20">na hata ka nahela totso, acho chanongile ching'ambonese nene nina totso.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />Nene nahela totso, lekeni nene nakona si chinu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:21">hata ugima wangu wenyegho noubetsa.<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />Agho ghose chinu chimwe, apfo nolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:22">Yeye kowamalitsa wose, iwalihela matotso na iwehile.<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Maghayo haghakutsa na kukoma iwanu kwa kwidukitsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:23">yeye kowaseka iwanu iwalihela totso pfawotenyuka ghumoyo.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />Isi ing'aghwila mna ghamoko gha iwanu iwehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">Imulungu katsifumba tsinenge tsa iwalamlitsi wa isi ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">ka iyotenda apfo si yeye baye, lelo nani?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />Matsuwa ghangu ghopfosa himahima kubita imunu iyotsuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:25">ghopfosa bila ukona ighanoghile.<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />Ghopfosa himahima ka ingalawa ya midete.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:26">ka chitema iyomkweng'ula ichitsiya.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />Ning'alonga nitsesemwa ukulila kwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:27">lelo nichitende chihanga changu chileke koneka chinuna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:27">na nene nyoneke nisangalamka,<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />lekeni nene ning'ali nighapfuka ghamaghayo ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:28">kwaapfila nomanya ghweghwe kutsombona ka nene nina totso.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />Apfo ka nitsakoneka nina totso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:29">heule lelo nighanzike hela?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />Hata ka ning'oghile na ghamatsi ighelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:30">na kuhopfugha ghamoko ghangu kwa isabuni,<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />lekeni ghweghe kutsonyasa mna lipondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:31">hata ghamagwanda ghangu ghatsombona nyiha.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />Kwaapfila yeye si munu baye ka nene hebu nimwidike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:32">hata tughende kuna libalatsa tukahighe naye ghomba.<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />Kuduhu wakutulamlitsa twetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:33">iyodaha kutwikila ghumoko twose weli.<verse eid="JOB 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />Leka Imulungu yaisoghetse ing'weku yake mchanya mwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:34">ili aghala ighoghela wogha ghaleke kunitenda nipfuke,<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />apfo ning'alongile naye bila kumpfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:35">kwaapfila nene sili pfipfo baye mna ghumoyo ghwangu.<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />Nene nyipfa ukukala mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">kwa usungu wanili nawo, nitsolonga ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">nitsolonga apfila ghumoyo ghwangu pfaghukona usungu.<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />Nitsomlongela Imulungu, “Uleke kunihigha ka nitotsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:2">lekeni unilongele angu una choni na nene?<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />Angu kwakona pfinogha ukunidununza nene?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">Heule unilema, nene inili sang'ano ya ghamoko ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">na kosekelela chawobama kutenda iwehile?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />Pfihi ghweghwe kuna nenge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:4">au pfihi kwakona ka iwanu pfawakona?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />Pfihi matsuwa ghako ka ghamatsuwa gha imunu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:5">na miyaka yako ka imiyaka ya imunu?<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />Mbaka koghutsa ghutsa ighehile ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:6">na kubamabama wone inzambi yangu?<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />Aku ghweghwe komanya ghendo ka nene nahela totso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:7">wala kuduhu munu iyodaha kuniswekula nilawe mna ghamoko ghako.<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />Ghamoko ghako ghanifina na ghaniumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:8">naghwe sambi kughalambuka na konikoma.<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />Ukumbuke ka kuniumba kwa lidongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:9">pfihi kutsombuyitsa kuna litimbwisi keli?<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />Pfihi si ghweghwe baye yunighidile ka tombo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:10">na kuniganditsa ka jibini?<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />Kuluumba ilukuli lwangu kwa mipate na tsinyughe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:11">na kulughubika kwa inyama na ngotsi.<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />Kungaya ugima na kunitendela uluso mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:12">kwa apfila pfaunyalangitse iloho yangu iwa na ugima.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />lekeni aghano ghose kughapfisa mmoyo mwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:13">na nomanya achi chicho chaubamile kutenda.<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />Ka ning'atendile nzambi ghweghwe ung'ambonile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:14">wala tsang'uleka ukunihigha baye.<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />Ka nene nitenda ghehile, nitsochona!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">Hata ka nene notenda ighobamighwa, sidaha baye kwinula litwi lyangu nitunye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">kwaapfila nina chinyala chikulu, hanilola ghamaghayo ghangu.<verse eid="JOB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />Ning'enula litwi lyangu uchanya nighode, ghweghwe koniwinda ka isimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:16">na kutsolangusa ngupfu yako ng'ulu inilagha nene.<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />Ghweghwe kongalilagha iwanu wako wanitowe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">na koghendelela kunighudubukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">kongalila makingili gha iwanu iwonyihila wandaghe.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />Hebali undapfile munda mwa mai wangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:18">Ng'apfu ning'afile ng'ana nenge ya munu imbone,<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />kwaapfila ning'awile soneke baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:19">ning'alumbilile ghendo kulawa munda mbaka kuna ilikabuli.<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />Angu matsuwa ghangu gha ukukala mgima ng'ambe ghachidogho?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:20">Leka kunitsupfa, tanu undeke chidogho mbone ng'apfu,<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />ng'ana mbuke ako baye, akula nene ning'aghenda sidaha kuya keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:21">ako kuna isi ya hutsuni, na chisi totolo,<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />kuna isi ina chilo chikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">na chisi totolo, na ina ipfulughu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">ako ghumwanga ghwenyegho ka chisi.”<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="s">Sofari kolonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Kuya Sofari, iyolawa Naamati kamwidika Ayubu, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />Pfihi aghano ghose ghaulonga ghaleke kwidikighwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:2">Angu kulonga longa ako kokutenda woneka kwahela totso.<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />Angu ukulongeleka kwako kuwatende iwanu wenyamale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:3">Naghwe haubetsa imunu yaleke kukumanila?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />Kwaapfila kolonga, chanilonga nolongesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:4">na nene nyela hambele ha Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />Ka Imulungu yang'alongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:5">na yang'asame ghumlomo ghwake yakwidike,<verse eid="JOB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />yakulongele ihekima ipfisike iyali nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">kwaapfila kuna pfinu pfingi pfa Imulungu ing'apfimanyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">na umanye ghendo ka nzambi tsako tsingi Imulungu katsisemwa.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />Pfihi kodaha kutanga ipfinu pfose ipfipfisike pfa Imulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:7">Pfihi kodaha kumanya Imulungu yana ingupfu pfayakwanzila na pfayotsighila?<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />Ukulu wake wobita kulanga, udaha kutenda choni ghweghwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">Ukughenda hasi kwake kobita kutsimu, angu umanya choni ghweghwe?<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />Ung'aulinga na isi, wobita isi yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:9">hata ughatsi wa ibahali woubita.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />Ka Imulungu kobita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:10">na kowaghogha iwanu yawaghale kuna libalatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:10">nani yodaha kumghoma?<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />Yeye katsowatanga ghendo iwanu iwaghutsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:11">Angu yang'ona ghehile, ng'otenda chinu baye?<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />Lekeni imunu mbotsi ng'odaha kuwa na mbutsi baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:12">ka apfila ichihongwe wa kubagho pfang'odaha kweleka munu.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />Ung'aghulapfa ghumoyo ghwako ghwose kuna yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:13">na ung'agholosa ghamoko ghako kuna yeye umlombe,<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />ka kuna nzambi mmoko mwako, tsase kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:14">na uleke kutoghola ghehile ghakale mkaye yako.<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />Baho kutsakwinula ichihanga chako bila koneka ka kutotsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:15">kutsakuwa na ngupfu na ng'utsopfuka baye.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />Naghwe kwitsesemwa ghamaghayo ghako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:16">naghwe kutsoghakumbuka ka apfila matsi gha imvula ighabitile.<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />Ugima wako utsong'aika kubita tsuwa ilikwalika nemisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:17">hata ka kutsakuwa na chisi, kutsakoneka ka nemitondo.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />Naghwe kutsakuwa kwahela wogha kwapfila kunacho cha ukulolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:18">Imulungu katsokukinga na kutsobwihila tseghamba.<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />Pfipfila kutsowasa aku kuduhu munu iyokutenda upfuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:19">na wanu wengi watsokubama uwatendele ighanoghile.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />Lekeni tsinenge tsa iwanu iwehile tsisakwingila chisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">na ng'awatsoyona baye inzila ya ukutsumila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">na wololela chinu chimwe, nacho lifwa.<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Kuya Ayubu kawedika,<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />Ona, mwemwe mwa wanu ghendo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:2">na ihekima itsomala ahala mwemwe hamtsakufa.<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />Lekeni na nene nina mbutsi ka mwemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">nene sili munu hela baye kuna mwemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">Angu nani ng'aghamanyile baye aghano ghose?<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />Nene niwa munu wa kusekighwa na sale tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">tsanimkema Imulungu, naye tsakanyidika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">lekeni niwa munu wa kusekighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">hata ka nene nina haki na nahela totso.<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Imunu iyobweda kowaseka iwoghaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:5">chayofikitsa yeye ukughaya kowatsila awala iwateletse.<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />Ghamahema gha iwanu iwoboka ghokala tseghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">na awala iwomghobola Imulungu wokala wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">awala iwomwika imulungu wawo mna ghamoko ghawo.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />Lekeni sambi muwaghutse wanyama, nawo watsowafunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:7">waghutseni wapfideghe wali mlanga, nawo watsowalongela.<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />Ighutse isi, nayo isi itsokufunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:8">na waghutseni wasomba wali mna ibahali, nawo watsowapetela.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />Angu nani mna awano wose ing'amanyile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:9">ka ghumoko ghwa IMNDEWA ghugho ighutendile aghano?<verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />Yeye mmoko mwake mna ugima wa chila chiumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:10">na imuhe ya chila munu pfipfila ya mmoko mwake.<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />Apfi si lighutwi baye ililghetsa ghamalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:11">ka apfila ilulimi pfalulanza ichijo?<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />Iwanu iwalalile wawo iwali na hekima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:12">na awala iwakalile matsuwa mengi wawo iwomanya.<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />Lekeni ihekima na ngupfu yakwake yeye Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:13">yeye kana tsimbutsi tsose na komanya chila chinu,<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />yeye yang'abomola, kuduhu iyodaha kutsenga keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:14">yang'amwoha imunu, kuduhu iyodaha kumdohola,<verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />yang'akima ghamatsi, twopata chiyanga yanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:15">yang'aghalekelela, isi yomema ghamatsi.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />Kuna yeye kuna ngupfu na ihekima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:16">iwoghutsuka na iwoghutsukighwa wose wake yeye.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />Yeye kowatenda iwakulu wange chidako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:17">na iwalamlitsi kowatenda wawe wabotsi.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />Yeye kowatsula iwafalume itsikofiya tsawo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:18">na kowoha misipi ya utumwa mna ipfuno pfawo.<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />Yeye kowatsula iwatambika ghamagwanda ghawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:19">na kowaghwisa hasi iwanu wana tsingupfu<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />Yeye kowaboka ingufu ya ukulonga iwanu awala iwotogholeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:20">na kowaboka ihekima iwanzehe.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />Kowaghela chinyala iwatawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:21">na kowaboka tsisilaha awala wana tsingupfu.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />Koghubula kulawa mchisi aghala ighapfisike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:22">na kogheka hatselu aghala ighakalile mna ichisi totolo.<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />Kotsitenda tsiisi tsiwe ng'ulu, kuya hambele kotsihinya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:23">kowongetsa iwanu wa isi wawe wengi, kuya kowaleka wapwililike.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />Kowaboka ipfilongotsi wa tsiisi tsimbutsi tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:24">na kowaleka wange wange kunyika kulihela nzila,<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />kuko wobamasabamasa mchisi kulihela ghumwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:25">na kowatenda watsenzeuke ka imunu iyapatike.<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />Lola! Nenge tsangu tsona aghano ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:1">na maghutwi ghangu ghahulika na kughamanya agho.<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />Agho ghose ghammanya mwemwe, na nene pfipfila nighamanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:2">nene sili munu hela baye kuna mwemwe,<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />lekeni nobama nilonge na Imulungu yana Ingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:3">nobama ghomba lyangu nilonge na yeye Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />Ila mwemwe, mwonitungila ughutsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:4">wose mwawaghanga ing'amdaha chinu baye.<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />Ng'apfu mng'enyamale ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:5">aho mng'oneke mna hekima!<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />Lelo tegheletsani chanilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:6">na mhulilke achila chaniwadedesa kwa ghumlomo ghwangu.<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Apfi mtsomlongelela Imulungu kwa ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:7">na mtsomlongelela kwa ughutsu?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />Pfihi mwobama kumnoghelesa Imulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:8">Pfihi mwodaha kumlongelela Imulungu mna lighomba lyake.<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />Angu itsakuwa pfinogha kuna mwemwe ka yeye yang'awakaghula mwemwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:9">Pfihi mwodaha kumghutsukila Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:9">ka pfamuwaghutsukila iwanu?<verse eid="JOB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />Yeye katsowamanila ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:10">ka mwowanoghelela iwanu chinyelenyele.<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />Angu ukulu wake ng'aumtendani mpfuke baye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:11">Apfi pfayoghela wogha mwemwe ng'ampfuka baye?<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Agho ghamlonga gheghala na lipfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:12">ghamlonga mwiyamile si chinu ghendo baye, gheghala na ubanda ubomoka wa lidongo lya widi.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />Nyamaleni, mnileke nilonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:13">na agho ighatsondawila ghalekeni ghamdawile.<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />Hebali niyike nimwenyegho mna ukufa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:14">na niwaghitse ugima wangu iuli mna ghamoko ghangu?<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />Lola, yeye katsonikoma, lekeni nene ning'ali nomlolela yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:15">ona ghendo, nitseyamila tsinzila tsangu hambele hake.<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Ning'atenda apfo, pfipfo pfanitsoswekuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:16">kwaapfila imunu ing'ayompfuka Imulungu ng'atsodaha kumsoghelela baye.<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />Tegheletseni ghoya ghamalonga ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:17">na ghanilonga ghengile mmaghutwi mwenu.<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />Mlole lelo, nilika ghoya ghomba lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:18">kwaapfila nomanya ghendo nene nahela matotso.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />Angu nani iyatsonipfughulila ghomba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:19">Ka kabaho, nene nitsenyamala tulu nife.<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />Lekeni ghwe Imulungu, unitendela ipfinu apfino pfili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:20">na nene sitsopfisa chinu baye kuna ghweghwe.<verse eid="JOB 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />Tanu usoghetse kutali ghumoko ghwako kulawa hana nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:21">kuya uleke kunenda nipfuke na mbone wogha.<verse eid="JOB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />Baho unikeme na nene nitsokwidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:22">au unileke nilonge, naghwe unyidike.<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />Nene nitendile ghehile mangapi, na nzambi tsangu ngapi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:23">Unilanguse litotso lyangu na inzambi yangu.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />Heule upfisa uhanga wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:24">na kombona nene ka na aduwi yako?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />Pfihi kutsolughela wogha lutsani iluhighisighwa na libeho?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:25">Au kutsoiwinzilitsa imibangu inyalile?<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />Kwaapfila kunyandikila pfinu pfa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:26">na kunitwika tsinzambi tsangu tsa usongolo.<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />Koghoha ghamaghulu ghangu mna iminyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">na kotsiwinza nzila tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">na kwakwika chitango haghokanyagha ghamatsayo ghangu.<verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />Apfo imunu komala ka chinu cholile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:28">ka gwanda lijighwe na wang'onyo.<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />Imunu iyelekighwe na ipinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:1">matsuwa ghake gha ukukala chidogho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:1">nagho ghamema maghayo mengi.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />Kosanula ka luwa, kuya koholola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:2">kakuwa ka chimbeho ichisumka ukubita, wala ng'okala baye.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />Hebali utsodola tsinenge tsako kwa imunu ka ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:3">na komghala hambele hako umhighe?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />Nani iyodaha kulapfa chinu chelile kulawa mna chinu chihile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:4">Kuduhu ghendo iyodaha.<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />Kwaapfila matsuwa ghayokala imunu ghapetighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">naghwe koimanya imiyetsi yake mingapi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">na kumwikila imibaka naye ng'odaha baye kuiloka.<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />Uleke kumlola yeye, umleke yadeng'elele ukumalitsa ghamatsuwa ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:6">ka ichibaluwa pfayodeng'elela ukumalitsa ing'onde yake.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />Kwaapfila hata ghumbiki ghuna cha ukulolela ahala haghuganighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">kwaapfila ghutsotsuka keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">na nyotela tsake ng'atsileka baye ukutsuka.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />Hata ka imitsisi yake inyalila mna litimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:8">na lisina lyake kufila mwidongo,<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />lekeni kwa mnyeke ghwa ghamatsi ghutsotsuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:9">naghwo ghutsotula maputila ka mbiki ghwotile sambi.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />Lekeni imunu kakufa, na ako kuko ukumala kwake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:10">kolapfa imuhe ya ukumalitsila, naye kohupa ghendo.<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />Ka apfila ghamatsi pfaghonyala mna ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:11">au ka apfila ghamatsi gha ilukolongo pfaghakuhwa na kunyala,<verse eid="JOB 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />apfi pfipfo pfayakufa imunu, na ng'akwinuka keli baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">mbaka kulanga hakuhupa, ng'atsolamka baye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">wala kwinuka mna tsinongo.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />Ng'apfu ung'anipfisile kutsimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">ung'anipfisile mbaka imaya yako haitsohola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">na ghamatsuwa ghaunyikile ghang'amala, unikumbuke keli.<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />Pfihi imunu yang'afa, kakuwa mgima keli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">Ing'awa apfo, nene nitsobetetsa mna ghamatsuwa ghangu gha ukughaya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">na nitsobetetsa mbaka ghamaghayo ghangu haghatsotsigha.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />Ghweghwe kutsokema, na nene nitsokwidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:15">na kutsobama ukumbona nene yuniumbile kwa ghamoko ghako.<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />Lelo sambi ghweghwe kopeta tsihatua tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:16">lekeni uleke kukaghula tsinzambi tsangu,<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />na ghamatotso ghangu ghekighwa mna ghumkoba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:17">naghwe koghubika ighehile ghangu.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />Lekeni ka apfila lidunda pfalikilimka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:18">na ka apfila libambalawe pfalibuka hanu hake,<verse eid="JOB 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />ka apfila ghamatsi mengi ighobita pfaghosughula na kumoghola ghamabwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">na ka apfila ghamatsi ghamemile pfaghokulusa lidongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">apfi pfipfo naghwe pfaumtenda imunu yaleke kuwa na chinu cha ukulolela.<verse eid="JOB 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />Ghweghwe kuna ngupfu kumbita yeye matsuwa ghose, naye kopfosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:20">na ghweghwe kochighalusa ichihanga chake, na komwasa kutali.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />Iwanaghe wakwing'ighwa ukulu, lekeni yeye ng'omanya baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:21">wang'ahulumsighwa, yeye ng'otanga baye.<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Chayakona yeye usungu wa ilukuli lwake imwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:22">naye katsedomboketsela imwenyegho.<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="s">Elifazi kolonga keli na Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Kuya Elifazi, munu wa Temani kamwidika Ayubu, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />Angu, imunu yana ihekima kodaha kwidika bila kumanya chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:2">ka imunu yana lida limemile libeho lya Mashaliki?<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />Apfi kodaha kulonga malonga ing'aghomwapfila imunu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:3">malonga ing'aghokindika?<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />Lekeni ghweghwe kobetsa hata ukumpfuka Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:4">na koghoma ukumlomba Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />Kwaapfila tsinzambi tsako tsokulangulitsa ulonge ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:5">naghwe kusaghula ukulonga ka wanu iwobugha.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />Ghumlomo ghwako ghumwenyegho ghokuhigha, wala si nene baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:6">na ilulimi lwako lwenyegho lwolangusa ghendo.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />Angu ghweghwe kwa wakwanza ukwelekighwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:7">Au pfihi ghweghwe koneka ng'ana ipfidunda pfoneke baye?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />Pfihi ghweghwe tsaung'ali uhulikitsa mna libalatsa lya Imulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:8">Angu ihekima kwinayo ghweghwe uliyeka?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />Chinu chachi chaumanya twetwe ngatuchimanyile baye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:9">Chautanga choni ghweghwe twetwe tuleke kuchitanga?<verse eid="JOB 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />Mna twetwe kuna wanu wana tsimvi na iwalalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:10">na wabala kubita hata aba wako.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />Apfi ukukanza kwayokukanza Imulungu kudodo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:11">Angu ukulonga kwake kwa kuhola si chinu baye kuna ghweghwe?<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />Heule ughudubuka mmoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:12">mbaka tsinenge tsako tsiyauke?<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />Mbaka iloho yako yomghudubukila Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:13">na kolonga mbuli tsihile kwa ghumlomo ghwako?<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />Angu imunu yali chinu chachi mbaka yoneka kela hambele ha Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:14">ayula yelekighwe na ipinga yakonekatse kana haki?<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />Ka Imulungu ng'owatoghola baye hata wamalaika wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:15">nalyo lilanga ng'alyelile baye hambele hake,<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />lelo itsakuwatse kwa imunu iyodesa na iyaghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:16">imunu ghendo iyotenda ghehile ka ukunwa ghamatsi!<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />Lelo nitegheletse, na nene nitsokulangusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:17">nitsokulongela aghala ghambonile,<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />aghala iwana ihekima ghawalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:18">na iwahenga wao ng'awaghapfisile baye,<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />awala iweng'ighwe isi waliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:19">wala mgheni ng'ang'ile baye mna wao.<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />Imunu iyehile kodununzika kwa usungu matsuwa ghake ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:20">kwa miyaka yose yekilighwe ayula iyodununza wayaghe.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />Litsi lya ipfinu ipfighela wogha lyomwasukila mmaghutwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:21">hayokona kebweda ahala iwanu iwoboka womtsila.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />Imunu iyehile kahela lolelo lya kulawa mchisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:22">naye kobeta ukufa kwa ukukomighwa na lipanga,<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />koyunga yunga kobama ichijo, kolonga, chili kwani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:23">Naye komanya ghendo ka tsuwa lyake lya ghamaghayo lyahabehi.<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />Maghayo na usungu pfomtenda yapfuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:24">pfomtsila ka mfalume iyobama kwitowa ng'ondo.<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />Kwaapfila kagholosa ghumoko yamtowe Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:25">na kotamba ka kodaha kumhuma Imulungu iyana ingupfu,<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />kosumka kwa chidandali yamtowe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:26">akuno kana ingao ng'ulu na ing'aidaha kubeneka,<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />kwaapfila ichihanga chake chineneha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:27">na ichuno chake chineneha sideke.<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />Lekeni matsuwa ghakutsa katsokala mna imiji ilekighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">mna tsing'anda ng'atsikalighwa na munu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">tsing'anda itsitsakuwa mahame.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />Imunu ayo ng'atsakuwa tajili baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:29">na tsimali tsake ng'atsitsokala baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:29">wala ng'atsitsakongetseka baye muisi,<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />ng'atsolawa baye mna ichisi cha lifwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">yeye kakuwa ka mbiki, milambi ya ghumoto itsopfulutsa tsinyotela tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">na ghumuhe ghwa Imulungu ghutsomghulusa kutali.<verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />Yaleke kwighutsukila imwenyegho kwa kwihuwila ipfinu ipfili si chinu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:31">kwaapfila ng'atsopata chinu baye.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />Ayo katsolihighwa ng'ana matsuwa ghake ghapfike baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:32">na maputila ghake ng'aghatsakuwa na ubisi baye.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />Kakuwa ka mnzabibu ighulaghatsa tsinzabibu tsimbisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:33">na ka mnzeituni ighupaghatisa ghamaluwa ghake.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />Kwaapfila wose iwomlema Imulungu ng'awatsopata wana baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:34">na ghumoto ghutsolakatsa tsing'anda tsa iwabokela hongo.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />Wao wopanga pfinu pfa ung'enye, na wotenda ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:35">na imimoyo yawo yomema ughutsu.<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu komwidika Elifazi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Baho Ayubu kedika, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />Nene nihulika pfinu pfingi ka apfo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:2">mwemwe wose mwa wanu iwokanza imnitenda nighaye.<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />Angu ukulonga hela kwenu akuno kutsomala tsuwachi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:3">Apfi chinu chachi ichiwadesa mbaka mwoghendelela kulonga na nene?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />Nene pfipfila nodaha kulonga ka mwemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">ka mng'aghayile pfanighaya nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">ning'adahile kumlongani ghendo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">na kumhighisilani litwi lyangu.<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Ning'awaghumile ghumoyo kwa aghano ghanimlongelani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:5">mng'onile ng'apfu kwa achila chanilonga,<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />Hata ning'alonga, usungu wangu ng'auhola baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:6">na ning'enyamala tulu, pfipfila usungu wangu ng'aumala baye,<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Imulungu kanitenda nimale ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:7">kawatenda iwanu wa ikaye yangu wawe na uchuwa.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />Kungogha, na awo uwo ukalangama ulangusa iwanu ka nene nitotsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">na nene nisoka ng'ani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">hata uhanga wangu wolangusa ka nitotsa.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />Kwa imaya yake Imulungu kanitsahula tsahula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">kanighudubukila kwa kughegheda ghamatsino ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">kanitsodolela tsinenge tsake ka aduwi yangu.<verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />Iwanu wasama imilomo yawo wonibetsa na woniseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">wetingana hamwe wonitsingila na wonitsabula mmakanza.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />Imulungu kanighela kuna iwanu wana inzambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:11">na kanyasa mna ghamoko gha iwehile.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />Nene tsaning'ali nobweda, lekeni yeye kanibenabena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">kanifida isingo, kuya kanihonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">kanyimisa wima niwe hanu hake ha ukulengela imishale yake,<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />na iwanu wake iwakwasa imishale wanitsunguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">wotsihoma tsifigho tsangu, naye ng'onyonela libatsi baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">na kaimwagha hasi inyongo yangu kulawa kuna likini.<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />Koghendelela kunilagha na kunibena bena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:14">na konitsumila yanitowe ka asikali iyana ngupfu.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />Nidadatsa ghamaghunila ghawe nguo nipfale nidomboketse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:15">na ukulu wangu wose niumwagha mtimbwisi kulangusa ka nene nitowighwa,<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />chihanga changu chibutsuka kwa ukulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:16">tsikope tsangu tsiwa nitu ti,<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />hata ka ghamoko ghangu ng'aghatendile ighehile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:17">na ukulomba kwangu kwela.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />Ghwe isi, leka kughubika idamu yangu aila imwaghike hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:18">leka ichililo changu chenele chila hanu.<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />Lola, hata sambi iyonyamila kakulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:19">na yeye iyonilongelela kakuchanya.<verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />Sale tsangu wonibetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:20">lekeni nene tsinenge tsangu tsomlapfila masotsi Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />Ng'apfu yang'alawile baho munu wa kunilongelela kwa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:21">ka imunu pfayomlongelela isale yake.<verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />Kwaapfila ing'abita miyaka chidogho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:22">na nene nitsakuka, kulawa ako nene sitsakuya keli baye.<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />Ghumoyo ghwangu ghutenyuka ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:1">na ghamatsuwa ghangu ghatsigha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:1">likabuli lyonibeta.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />Iwonibetsa wanitsunguluka ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:2">tsinenge tsangu tsolola apfila pfawonighobola.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />Ghwe Imulungu, unyikile tsamana ghumwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:3">angu kuna nani yungi iyatsonyikila tsamana?<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />Ghweghwe kutsitenda mbutsi tsa sale tsangu tsileke kumanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:4">apfo uleke kuwaleka wanihume.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />Munu iyowabiduka sale tsake ili yeye yabwede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:5">tsinenge tsa iwanaghe ng'atsitsakona baye.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />Kanitenda niwe chinu cha kusekighwa na iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:6">niwa munu wakutemighwa ghamate.<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />Tsinenge tsangu ng'atsikona ghoya baye kwaapfila nina usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:7">lukuli lwangu lwose luwa lubewe ka chimbeho.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />Iwanu wana ihaki wokangawala hawakona aghano ighanilawile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:8">na awala iwalihela matotso wowaghudubukila awala yang'awompfuka Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />Hata apfo yana ihaki katsoikinda inzila yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:9">na ayula iyotenda ghanoghile katsakongetsighwa ingupfu.<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />Lekeni mwemwe mtse, mtse wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:10">na sitsomwona baye imunu yana ihekima mna mwemwe.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />Ghamatsuwa ghangu ghamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:11">ghanibamile kutenda ghahinyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:11">ghanilolele mmoyo mwangu ghahupa.<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />Iwanu awano wotenda ichilo chiwe misi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:12">kuna ichisi wao wolonga, ghumwanga ghwahabehi.<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />Ka ning'alolela kutsimu kuko ukaye yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:13">na ning'atandika ichilagho changu mchisi,<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />ning'alikema likabuli, nilonge, ghweghwe kwa aba wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:14">na kumlongela membele, ghweghwe kwa wenye wangu na lumbu wangu,<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />lelo lolelo lyangu lili kwani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:15">Na nani yatsolyona lilolelo lyangu alyo?<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />Pfihi litsohulumka kuna ghamalango gha kutsimu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:16">Pfihi litsohulumka hamwe na nane ako kuna litimbwisi?<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="s">Bilidadi kakwidika</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Baho Bilidadi, kulawa Shuhi kedika, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />Kutsobama bama cha ukulonga mbaka tsuwachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:2">Tanu walangule, hambele twetwe tutsolonga.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />Heule twetwe twakoneka ka twawanyama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:3">Heba twetwe twakoneka ka wabotsi hambele hako?<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />Kwelagha ghumwegho kwa imaya yako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">Pfihi isi ilekighwe iliyeka kwaajili yako ghweghwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">Angu ghamambalawe ghabulighwe kulawa hanu hake?<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />Ona, ghumwanga ghwa imunu yehile ghutsimighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:5">na lilambi lya ghumoto ghwake litsimika.<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />Na ghumwanga ighuli mna ing'anda yake ghuwa chisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:6">na itala ikighwe mchanya mwake imwangatsile itsotsimika,<verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />na matsayo ghake ghana ingupfu ghatsohungutsighwa ingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:7">ghayobama kutenda ghatsomghwisa hasi.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />Matsayo ghake mwenyegho ghatsomwonza mna lwapfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:8">na imighulu yake imwenyegho itsoghoghighwa,<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />inyonzo itsomwonza kuna ichisegheyu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:9">nayo itsomnanahila kwa ngupfu.<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Wampfisila inyonzo hasi mna lidongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:10">na ghumtegho ghwikighwa mna inzila yake.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />Wogha utsomtenda yapfuke chila ubali wayoghenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:11">utsomuwinzilitsa chila hayokanyagha litsayo lyake.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />Inzala yommalitsa tsingupfu tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:12">na ghamaghayo ghombeta ghampate hayatsakughwa hasi.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />Ghamaghayo agho ghatsoija ingotsi yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:13">na utamu wihile utsakuja ipfilungo pfa ilukuli lwake.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />Imunu iyehile katsong'olighwa kulawa hana ing'anda yake iyeihuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:14">na katsoghalighwa kuna imfalume iyopfukighwa.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />Mna ing'anda yake ng'amtsokala chinu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:15">ghumoto ghwa chibiliti ghutsolakatsa chila chinu mkaye yake.<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />Yeye keghala na mbiki ghuna imitsitsi inyalila mwidongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:16">na ghamaputila ghake ghatsosakalila mchanya.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />Naye ng'atsokumbukighwa baye muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:17">na mna isi litaghwa lyake ng'alitsakuwa keli baho baye.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />Imunu iyehile wamlapfa hana ghumwanga wamwasa kuna ichisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:18">wamuwinga kutali yalawe mna isi.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />Yeye kahela wana wala watsukulu mna iwanu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:19">wala ng'alekile mwana baye kokose kwayakalile.<verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />Iwanu iwokala maghalibi wakangawala na aghano ighampatile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:20">na iwanu iwokala mashaliki wengilighwa na wogha.<verse eid="JOB 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />Ona, ghendo atso tsitso tsing'anda tsa imunu iyehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:21">pfipfo pfahali hanu hayokala imunu ing'ayammanyile Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Kuya Ayubu kedika, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />Angu mtsoghendelela kunidununza mbaka tsuwachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:2">na kunikeng'ena kwa ghamalonga ghenu?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />Sambi aluno lwa kumi mwemwe mwononga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:3">angu ng'amkona chinyala baye ukunitendela pfihile?<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Na hata ka nitotsa ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:4">alyo totso lyangu nene wala si lyenu baye.<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />Hata ka mwetenda ghendo mwoneke wakulu kubita nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:5">hata ka ukughaya kwangu komtendani mnonge.<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />Mmanye ghendo ka Imulungu yuyo iyanitendele ghehile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:6">naye kanyonza mna ghumtegho ghwake.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />Hata ning'angula chililo, nilonge, notendelighwa pfihile, nene sihulikitsighwa baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">hata ning'akemelela nyapfilighwe, kuduhu wa ukunitendela ihaki.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />Yeye Imulungu kaidiwa inzila yangu ndeke kupfosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:8">kaighela ichisi nzila yangu.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />Kautsula ukulu wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:9">kalitsula litaji lili mwitwi mwangu.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />Kanibena bena chila ubali, na nimala ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:10">kaling'ola lilolelo lyangu ka mbiki.<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />Yeye konilakatsa kwa imaya yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:11">naye kombona ka na yumwe wa maaduwi tsake.<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />Maasikali wake wonitsila kwa ngupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">wanyikila lundo lya ghamabwe gha ukunidinila nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">nawo walitsunguluka lihema lyangu.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />Kaweka ndughu tsangu wakale kutali na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:13">na sale tsangu wa wanibaghula ghendo.<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />Ndughu tsangu wose woka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:14">na sale tsangu wa habehi wanisemwa ghendo.<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />Iwokala mkaye yangu na iwatumwa wangu mapinga wombona nene namgheni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">nene niwa mgheni ghendo mna tsinenge tsawo.<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />Nomkema mtumighwa wangu, lekeni yeye ng'onyidika baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:16">hata ka nomlomba kwa ghumlomo ghwangu yanyapfile.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />Imuhe yanihumula yomnung'ila pfihile imwehe wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:17">hata ndughu tsangu wombona nowadesa.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />Hata iwana wadodo wonibetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:18">hanikoneka, wao wonilonga pfihile.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />Sale tsangu wakulu wose wonyihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:19">na awala waniwakundile wanihunduka.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />Nisoka mbaka imipate na ingotsi inanahila hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:20">nene nisungulila likabuli, tsanikala habehi na ukufa.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />Mboneleni libatsi, mboneleni libatsi, mwemwe sale sangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:21">miyenu Imulungu yeye iyangayile ghamaghayo aghano.<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />Heule mwemwe mnidununza ka Imulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:22">Apfi ukughaya kwa ilukuli lwangu mwemwe ng'amkona baye?<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />Ing'awile pfinogha aghano ghanilonga sambi ghang'andikighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:23">ghang'andikighwe mna ichitabu.<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />Ghang'andikighwe kwa chinu cha chuma na lisasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:24">mchanya mwa libambalawe ili ghakale matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />Lekeni nomanya ghendo mkombola wangu kamgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:25">na hachitsigha chila chinu yeye katsakwima mchanya mwa isi yanyamile.<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />Na ingosti yangu aino ing'aihinyika baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:26">na aku ning'ali na ilukuli lwangu luluno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:26">nene nitsomwona Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />Nene nimwenyegho nitsomwona kwa nenge tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">nene nimwenyegho wala si munu yungi baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">Lola apfila pfayoninoghela mna ghumoyo ghwangu.<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />Ka mwolonga, tutsomdununza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:28">kwaapfila kana ghomba lyoneka mghati mwake,<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />mwemwe, mpfuke ukutowighwa na lipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">kwaapfila ukughudubuka kwenu kodaha kumtendani mtowighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">na baho mtsomanya ka kuna ukuhighighwa.<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="s">Sofari kakwidika</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Kuya sofari kulawa Naamati, kedika, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />Aghala ghaulongile ghonitenda nene nikwidike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:2">kwaapfila sidaha kwinyamala baye.<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />Nihulika maligho ghaunilighile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:3">lekeni sambi iloho yangu yonitenda nikwidike ka pfanimanya.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />Ghweghwe komanya ghendo apfila pfapfili kulawa ghumwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:4">tangiya iwanu hawekighwe mna isi,<verse eid="JOB 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />ka iwanu wehile wosekelela kwa matsuwa chidogho hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:5">na ka iwanu ing'awammanyile Imulungu wodeng'elela kwa chipindi chidogho hela,<verse eid="JOB 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />hata ka maghodo ghake ghopfika kulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:6">na hata ka litwi lyake lyopfika kuna ghamabingu,<verse eid="JOB 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />lekeni katsohupa ghendo ka mipfi yake imwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:7">na awala iwamwonile watsolonga, yalikwani?<verse eid="JOB 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />Katsohupa ka apfila pfaili indoto, na ng'atsakoneka keli baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:8">katsohupa ka pfaili indoto ya nechilo.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />Inenge imwonile, ng'aitsomwona keli baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:9">na hanu hake hayakalile ng'ahatsomwona keli baye.<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />Iwana wake watsowabama iwanu wahingwa wawatendele uluso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:10">na kwa ghamoko ghao wenyegho watsakuyitsa tsimali itsibokighwe.<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />Imipate ya ilukuli lwake tsaimema tsingupfu tsa usongolo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:11">lekeni tsose katsowasa natso mtimbwisi.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />Hata ka ighehile ghamta mna ghumlomo ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:12">na hata ka koghapfisa hasi ha ilulimi lwake,<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />na hata ka kolema ghendo ukughatema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:13">ila yeye koghafumba mna ghumlomo ghwake,<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />agho haghopfika munda ghakuwa ghosungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:14">ka sumu ya nzoka.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />Katsodeka tsimali tsayametsile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:15">Imulungu katsomtenda yatsideke kulawa mna lida lyake.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />Chayokong'a imunu yehile yiyo isumu ya nzoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:16">na ghamatsino gha nzoka yana isumu ghatsomluma na kumkoma.<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />Ng'atsopfona baye ipfikolongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:17">ipfikolongo ipfimemile uki na matsiwa.<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />Aghala ghayapatile kwa kughaya katsoghoyitsa bila kughaja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:18">ng'atsobweda baye kwa inyongetsa iyatsopata kwa ukuchulutsa ipfinu pfake.<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />kwaapfila tsakawaoneya wanu iwahingwa na kawaleka wahela chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:19">kaboka tsing'anda atsila yang'atsitsengile baye.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />Kwaapfila yeye ng'obwihila baye ukubama ukuja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:20">mng'anda mwake ng'amtsokala chinu baye,<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />Hayakuja yeye ng'oleka chinu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:21">lekeni sambi ukwebweda kwake ako kutsomala.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />Hayatsakuwa kenela kwa chila chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:22">baho ghamaghayo ghomtsila kwa ukwidukitsa.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />Baho hayatsobama kulimemetsa lida lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">Imulungu katsomghalila imaya yake ikwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">nayo itsomtowela ka mvula.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />Katsotsuma yahepe ukukomighwa na lipanga lya chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:24">lekeni ghumshale ghwa shaba ghutsomhoma.<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />Naye koghusomola kulawa kuna ilukuli lwake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">kusa ukumeletseka kwa ghumshale kutsakuwa na idamu ilawa kuna likini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">na baho wogha utsomwingila.<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />Chisi chikulu chobetetsa chila chinu chayekile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">ghumoto ing'aghutuwighwe na munu ghutsomlakatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">na ghutsolambita chila chinu chikalile mng'anda mwake.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />Kulanga kutsoghubula ighehile ghake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:27">na isi itsakwinuka imlonge.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />Ghamatsi gha imvula ighamemile ghatsotsimwagha tsimali tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:28">mna litsuwa lya imaya ya Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />Achi chicho imunu yehile chayakwing'ighwa na Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:29">chicho Imulungu chayamwikile.<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu komwidika Sofari</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />Kuya Ayubu kedika, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />“Tegheletsani ghoya achino chanilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:2">namwe hamtsohulikitsa mtsonikanza ghoya.<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />Hanilonga mndeke nonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:3">na hanimalitsa kulonga, ghendeleleni ukuniseka.<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />Nene sisonga na iwanu baye, ila nesonga na Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:4">Heule lelo ndeke kubetetsa?<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />Mndole, namwe mkangawale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:5">mdiwe imilomo yenu kwa ghamoko ghenu.<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />Hanikwalangula aghano ighandawile, nene nopfuka ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:6">na baho ilukuli lwangu lwoghudema.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />Heule iwanu wehile woghendelela kukala wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:7">mbaka wolala, na wakongetseka tsingupfu?<verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />Wowona iwana wao pfawobweda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:8">na nenge tsawo tsowona iwatsukulu wao.<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />Tsing'anda tsawo tsokala tulu ghendo, wala kuduhu ukupfuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:9">wala Imulungu ng'owatowa baye.<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />Wang'ombe wao wamale wana ngupfu tsa ukuwadina wang'ombe pinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:10">na wang'ombe wao pinga wakweleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:10">nawo ng'awohosa baye.<verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />Wanu wehile wowalapfa iwana wao kunze ka kingili lya ng'olo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:11">na iwana wao wobigha bigha.<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />Wakwimba aku wotowa tsingoma na pfing'weng'we,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:12">na wodeng'elela hawohulika ichimbeta chotowighwa.<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />Matsuwa ghao ghose wokala kwa kubweda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:13">nawo mbaka hawakufa ng'awoghaya baye.<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />Lekeni tsawamlongela Imulungu, ‘Utuleke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:14">ng'atubama baye tumanye tsinzila tsako,<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />Imulungu yana ngupfu yali nani mbaka tumsang'anile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:15">Angu tupata choni kwa kumlomba yeye?’<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />Wawo wofikitsa ukubweda kwao kwa mmoko mwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:16">lekeni nene sitoghola baye acho chawakwalangula iwanu wehile.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />Angu mala ngapi itala ya wanu wehile yotsimika?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">Apfi mala ngapi maghayo ghowatsila iwanu wehile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">Angu mala ngapi Imulungu kowaghalila usungu kwa imaya yake?<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />Angu mala ngapi wawa ka tsani lihighisighwa na libeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:18">na wawa ka mibangu isolighwa na inyahemu?<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />Namwe mwolonga, ‘Imulungu kogheka ighehile gha imunu ghatse ghawapate iwanaghe,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:19">leka yamlihe imwenyegho, yamanye ighehile ghake,<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />Yone kwa tsinenge tsake imwenyegho pfayokomighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:20">yone imaya ya Imulungu yana ingupfu.<verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Angu munu yafile kodaha kuwalangula iwananaghe wayowaleka kuchughu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:21">ahala imiyetsi yake haitsohupa?<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />Angu kuna munu iyodaha kumfunda Imulungu ukumanya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:22">Ng'ambe yeye yuyo iyowahigha hata iwakulu?<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />Munu yumwe kakufa na ngupfu tsake tsose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:23">na ugima wake wose kakala tulu ghendo na kabweda,<verse eid="JOB 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />akuno ilukuli lwake ludegheta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:24">na imipate yake ina ngupfu.<verse eid="JOB 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />Yungi kakufa akuno ugima wake wose ukala na usungu mmoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:25">wala ng'ana yalanze chinu chinoghile baye.<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />Na wose wowasa mtimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:26">wose wamembele wowaghubika.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />Nene nomanya ghendo champfikitsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:27">na aghala ghehile ghambama kunitendela.<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />Kwaapfila mwolonga, ‘Ing'anda ya imkulu ilikwani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:28">lilikwani lihema lyawakalile iwanu wehile?’<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />Pfihi ng'amuwaghutsile baye awala iwabita nzila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:29">Angu ng'amtoghole baye aghala ghawamlongeleni?<verse eid="JOB 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />Ka munu yehile kolekelighwa mna matsuwa gha ukughaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:30">naye kokombolighwa mna litsuwa lya imaya?<verse eid="JOB 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />Angu nani iyodaha kulonga ghawotenda iwanu wehile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:31">Angu nani iyodaha kuwaliha kwa aghala ghawatendile?<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />Yeye koghalighwa kuna likabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:32">na iwanu wokalitsa likabuli lyake.<verse eid="JOB 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />Wanu wengi womuwinza kuchughu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">wamwenga womlongolela hayoghenda kutsikighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">kuya iwanu womwasila lidongo lughalugha mna likabuli.<verse eid="JOB 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />Lelo mwemwe mdahatse kunikanza kwa kulonga ubotsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:34">ghose ghamnyidika ghahela chinu, ila ghamema ughutsu uliyeka.”<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="s">Elifazi Kakwidika lwakadatu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />Kuya Elifazi, kulawa Temani kamwidika Ayubu kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />“Angu imunu kodaha kumwapfila Imulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:2">Apfi imunu yana ihekima kodaha kumtenda Imulungu yebwede?<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />Angu ghweghwe komdeng'elesa Imulungu kwa koneka kugholoka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:3">Hata ka tsinzila tsako tsinogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:3">angu yeye yatsopata choni?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />Angu apfila pfaumpfuka Imulungu ng'ambe komtenda yakumanile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:4">na yakughale kuna libalatsa?<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />Angu ighehile ghako si makulu baye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:5">Na tsinzambi tsako tsahela ha ukutsighila.<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />Kumbama ndughu yako yakulihe sendi yakukopile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:6">na kuwatsula magwanda ghawo, kuwaleka chidako.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />Kuwema ghamatsi awala iwepfile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:7">na awala wana inzala kuwema ichijo.<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />Kumleka imunu yana tsingufu yaisole isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:8">na kumleka imunu iyotegheletsighwa yakale mumo.<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />Kumleka ichitsuka yoke chimokomoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:9">na ng'uwonele libatsi baye iwachuwa.<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />Apfo imitegho ikutsingila chila ubali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:10">na wogha ukutsile kwa kwidukitsa ukughogha.<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />Ichisi chikutsinga uleke kona chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:11">na matsi ghakutsinga<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />Angu Imulungu ng'ali kuchanya kulanga baye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:12">Lola, kakuchanya kubita tsinondo tsose.<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />Lekeni kolonga, ‘Angu Imulungu yomanya choni?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:13">Katsodaha kuhigha kulawa mna chisi chikulu?<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />Mabingu makulu ghamdiwa, apfo ng'otwona baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:14">yeye kakwanga kuna lilanga.<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />Pfihi kutsokala ka pfaukalile ghumwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:15">apfila pfawakalile iwanu wehile?<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />Wao wahupa ng'ana matsuwa ghao ghapfike baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:16">imisingi ya ugima wawo ikululusighwa na ghamatsi.<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />Wawo tsawamlongela Imulungu apfino, ‘Tuleke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:17">angu Imulungu yana ingupfu yodaha kututenda choni?’<verse eid="JOB 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />Na yeye yuyo iyatsimemetse tsing'anda tsao ipfinu pfinoghile.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:18">Lekeni nene sitoghola baye acho chawakwalangula iwanu wehile.<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />Iwanu wana ihaki woghona agho igholawila na wodeng'elela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:19">na iwalihela matotso nawo wowaseka, wolonga,<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />‘Maaduwi tsetu wakomighwa ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:20">na ghumoto ghulakatsa tsimali tsawo tsawalekile.’<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />Lelo, Ayubu umtoghole Imulungu, ukale tseghamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:21">na baho ighanoghile ghatsokutsila.<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />Bokela aghala ghayokufunda igholawa mna ghumlomo ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:22">na ghayokulongela ugheke mmoyo mwako.<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />Ung'amyila Imulungu wako yana ingipfu, kutsohona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:23">na ung'agheka ighehile ghakale kutali na ng'anda yako,<verse eid="JOB 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />uyone inzahabu yako ka timbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:24">na uyone inzahabu ya Ofili ka libwe lya kulukolongo,<verse eid="JOB 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />baho Imulungu yana ingupfu katsakuwa nzahabu yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:25">na katsakuwa fetsa yako ya bei ng'ulu kuna ghweghwe.<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />Naghwe kutsomdeng'elela Imulungu yana ingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:26">naghwe kutsakwinula uhanga wako umlolele Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />Kutsomlomba, naye katsokuhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:27">naghwe kutsotenda aghala ghaulongile kutsomtendela Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />Achila chaubama ukutenda, chitsotendeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:28">na ghumwanga ghutsomwemwesela tsinzila tsako.<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />Iwanu hawohulumsighwa, naghwe kutsolonga, ‘wenule keli,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:29">na baho yeye katsomkombola ayula iyehulumse.<verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />Naye katsomkombola hata ayula iyalihela totso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:30">naghwe kutsokombolighwa kwa aghala ighanoghile ghautendile.”<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kakwidika keli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Kuya Ayubu kedika, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />Hata lelolil nene nolongeleka aku ning'ali na usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:2">Imulungu koghendelela kunilagha akuno nene noghutilila.<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />Ng'apfu ning'amanyile hanu hanidaha ukumwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:3">hata aho hayokala ning'aghendile!<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />Ning'aghalile ghomba lyangu baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:4">na ning'alongile achila ichimemile mna ghumoyo ghwangu.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />Ning'amanyile achila chayonyidika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:5">na ning'atangile chayonilongela.<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />Angu yang'ayihile na nene kwa ngupfu tsake tsose?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:6">Baye! Yeye yang'anitegheletse ghendo.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />Baho imunu yana ihaki kodaha kulonga naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:7">Imulungu iyali mlamtsi wangu kodaha kundekelela matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />Lola, nighenda mashaliki, simpata baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:8">na ning'abwela maghalibi, simwona baye.<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />Ning'ambama kasikazini, simwona baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:9">ning'ahunduka kusini, simwona ghendo baye.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />Lekeni yeye komanya inzila yaniwinza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:10">na baho hayomalitsa ukunighetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:10">nitsolawa nyela ka nzahabu.<verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />Matsayo ghangu ghawinza haghang'ile maghulu ghake.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:11">Na inzila yake niiwinza, wala sibaghuke baye.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />Sighalekile baye ghamalaghitso ghayalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:12">ghamalonga ghake nigheka mna ghumoyo ghwangu.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />lekeni yeye ng'oghalambuka baye, nani iyodaha kumtenda yahunduke?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:13">Chayobama, chicho chayotenda.<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />Kwaapfila yeye kotenda aghala ghayabamile nendelighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:14">na kuna ghangi gha ukunitendela kenagho ka agho.<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />Agho ghonenda nene ningilighwe na wogha hambele hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:15">ning'aghalangula aghano ghose, nene nompfuka.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Imulungu kanitenyula ghumoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:16">Imulungu yana tsingupfu kanenda nene nipfuke.<verse eid="JOB 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />Hata apfo ichisi ng'achinendile nipfuke baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:17">wala ichisi totolo ichidiwa chihanga changu.<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />“Heule Imulungu ng'akwika baye ghamatsuwa gha ukuhigha?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:1">Heule awala iwommanya ng'awoghamanya baye matsuwa ka agho?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />Iwanu woseghetsa ghamabwe gha imibaka ya imighunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:2">woboka wanyama kwa ngupfu kuya wowadima hamwe na wakwao.<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />Womboka imchuwa ichihongwe wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:3">na womwika poni ing'ombe wa ichitsuka.<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />Wowakunughitsa iwahingwa mmbalimbali mwa inzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:4">na iwahingwa wali muisi wepfisa hawowona wao.<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />Iwahingwa wawa ka chihiongwe wa kumhulo iyali kuchiwala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">wawo wohemela ichijo kunyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">wapate chochose cha ukuweng'a iwana wao.<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />Wosalalitsa mna imighunda ili si yawo baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:6">na woghondola tsinzabibu mna imighunda ya iwanu wehile.<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />Chilo chigima wowasa chidako, wahela cha ukupfala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:7">wahela ghendo chakwighubika mna ichipfeghetsi.<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />Wapfulumka kwa imvula ya mna imidunda, na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:8">wobandaghala mna ghamabambalawe wepfise.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />Wabaho iwowaboka iwana wachuwa kulawa mmambagha mwa wenye wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:9">na wamwenga woweka poni iwana wa iwahingwa.<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />Lekeni iwahingwa wakwanga chidako, wahela cha ukupfala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:10">woduta ghamakinza gha ingano aku wana nzala.<verse eid="JOB 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />Wokama tsinzeituni wapate ghamapfuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:11">na wokama tsinzabibu wapate idipfai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:11">lekeni wawo wenyeho wang'ali wana ng'ilu.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />Ichililo cha iwanu iwakufa chohulikika kulawa kuna ghumji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">na iwanu iwalaghighwe wokemelela wobama wapfilighwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">lekeni Imulungu ng'otegheletsa baye chawolomba.<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />Awano wawo iwolema ghumwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">nawo ng'awomanya baye tsinzila tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">wala ng'awobama baye ukukinda tsinzila tsake.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />Mkoma wanu kolamka lupfilipfili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">yawakome iwahingwa na iwalihela chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">na ichilo hachipfika yeye kakuwa ka mbapfi.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />Na imunu mghoni kobetetsa chilo chingile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">akuno kolonga, ‘Kuduhu imunu yombona’,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">naye koughubika uhanga wake.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />Nechilo iwanu wobomola tsing'anda webe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">na nemisi wehindila mng'anda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">nawo ng'awobama koneke baye mna ghumwanga.<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />Kwaapfila kuna wawo chilo totolo chakuwa nemitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:17">na wawo ng'awopfuka baye igholawila mna ichisi totolo.<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />Lekeni wawo wahopfu mchanya mwa ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">na tsimali tsawo tsakuwa tsilighitighwa muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">kuduhu iyoghenda kusang'ana mna imighunda yawo ya mitsabibu.<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />Ka ibalafu pfailubuka mna msimu ghwa chiyangatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:19">pfipfo kutsimu pfakuwasola awala iwatendile tsinzambi.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />Mai tsawo iwaweleke watsowasemwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">wang'onyo watsowaja na watsowona wamta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">iwanu wehile ng'awatsokumbukighwa keli baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">lekeni watsobenighwa ka mbiki<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />Watsowatenda pfihile wapinga ing'awodaha ukweleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:21">na awala iwalihela wana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:21">na ng'awowonela libatsi baye ipfitsuka.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />Lekeni Imulungu kwa ngupfu tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:22">kowakoma iwanu wana tsingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:22">hata ka wokala kwa ukubweda, wao wahela lolelo lya ukukala wagima.<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />Kowaleka webone ka wobwihila na wokala tulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:23">lekeni tsinenge tsake tsolola ghawotenda.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />Iwehile wakwinulighwa matsuwa chidogho, kuya wohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">wohulumsighwa ka iwanu wangi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">wosakala na wakufa ka mitsani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">na woganighwa ka pfikungwi pfa ingano.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />Ka apfi si pfipfo baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:25">lelo nani yatsolangusa ka nene na mghutsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:25">na chanilonga si chinu baye?”<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="s">Bilidadi kakwidika</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Kuya Bildadi, kulawa Shuhi, kedika, kalonga.<verse eid="JOB 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />Ukulu yuyo iyali mkulu, iwanu wose wampfuke yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:2">yeye kotenda kulanga kukale tulu.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />Angu nani iyodaha kuwapeta maasikali wake iwomsang'anila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:3">Angu nani ghumwanga ghwake ng'aghummwemwesela baye?<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />Lelo imunu yodahatse koneka kana haki hambele ha Imulungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:4">Na imunu iyelekighwe na ipinga yodahatse kwela?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />Kuna yeye Imulungu, lwetsi ng'alung'ala baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:5">na tsinondo natso ng'atselile baye,.<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />lelo pfihi kwa imunu, iyali mng'onyo hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:6">imwana wa Imunu iyali fingi?<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Kuya Ayubu kedika, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />Ng'ambe apfi pfipfo pfaumwapfile imunu iyalihela ngupfu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:2">Na apfi pfipfo pfaughukombola ghumoko ghulihela ngupfu.<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />Lola apfila pfaumlongele tsimbuli tsa ukumwapfila imunu iyalihela ihekima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:3">naghwe kulonga pfinu pfingi pfaumanya.<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />Angu nani iyakwapfile kulonga agho?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:4">Na iloho ya nani ikulongotse ulonge apfo?<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bilidadi kakwidika</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />Iwanu wafile woghudema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:5">na iwali hasi ha ghamatsi na wase wali mumo pfoghudema,<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />Kutsimu kwamwatsi ghendo hambele hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:6">lipondo ilikemighwa Abadoni lyahela chighubiko cha ukumtenda Imulungu yaleke kona.<verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />Imulungu kakwanzatsa lilanga lya kaskazini hanu halihela chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:7">na koikondeka isi hanu ng'ahana chinu.<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />Koghakima ghamatsi mna ghamabingu matito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:8">na ghamabingu agho ng'aghotulika baye kwa utito awo.<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />Keka liduwala mna ichighoda chake cha ufalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:9">na kakwanzatsa libingu lyake mchanya mwake.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />keka liduwala mchanya mwa ghamatsi gha ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:10">keka ghumbaka ghughole ghumwanga na ichisi.<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />Tsigutso tsa kulanga natso tsoghudema na tsokangawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:11">yeye hayotsikembela.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />Kwa tsingupfu tsake kaihighisa ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:12">kwa ukumanya kwake tsakalihonda tsoka kulu lya ibahali ilikemighwa Rahabu.<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />Kwa ukuhumla kwake kakutenda kulanga kulangale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:13">na kwa ghumoko ghwake kalikoma litsoka ilitsuma.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />Na apfino pfinu chidodo ghendo mna tsisang'ano tsake tsayatendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">na apfila pfatuhulika iwanu wonong'onetsa napfo pfachigho ghendo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">Lekeni nani iyomanya ingupfu yake ahala hayodumilila kulanga?<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu komwidika Bilidadi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />Ayubu kaghendelela kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />Nelaha kwa Imulungu iyana ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">iyalemile kungaya ighali haki yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">iyaghutendile ghumoyo ghwangu ghwone usungu,<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />kwa matsuwa ghose ghanikala nohumula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:3">ka iloho ya Imulungu pfaikala mghati mwangu.<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />mlomo ghwangu ng'aghutsolonga ghehile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:4">wala lulimi lwangu ng'alutsolonga ughutsu baye.<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />Nene sitsotoghola ghendo baye ka mwemwe mwolongesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:5">nene nitsolonga nahela totso mbaka hanitsakufa.<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />Nitsoghendelela kulonga ka nene nina haki, wala sitsoleka baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:6">na ghumoyo ghwangu ng'aghutsonitama baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:6">mna matsuwa ghangu ghose ghanikala mgima.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />Awala iwonyihila wawe ka wanu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:7">na awala iwonibiduka wawe ka iwanu iwalihela ihaki.<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />Angu imunu ing'ayompfuka Imulungu yana choni cha ukulolela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:8">ahala Imulungu hayomwasa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:8">na ahala Imulungu hayomlapfa ugima wake?<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />Pfihi Imulungu katsohulika ichililo chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:9">ahala ghamaghayo haghomtsila?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Angu imunu iyehile katsodeng'elela hambele ha Imulungu yana ingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:10">na ukumlomba Imulungu matsuwa ghose?<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />Nitsowafunda uwetso wa Imulungu pfauli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:11">na tsinzila tsa Imulungu yana ingupfu sitsotsipfisa baye.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Lola, mwemwe mwose mwona muwenyegho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:12">heule lelo mlonga ubotsi?<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sofari komwidika Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />Achino chicho Imulungu chayamwikile imunu iyehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:13">na chayatsobokela imunu iyodununza iwanu kulawa kwa Imulungu yana ingupfu.<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />Hata ka iwanaghe watsakongetseka, watsokomighwa kung'ondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:14">na iwatsukulu wake ng'awatsakuwa na chijo cha ukuwenela baye.<verse eid="JOB 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />Na awala iwalekighwe wagima kung'ondo ghamatamu ghatsowakoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:15">na pfitsuka wao ng'awatsowalilila baye.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />Imunu yehile hata yang'alundika fetsa tsiwe ka timbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:16">hata yang'eka ghamagwanda ghawe mengi ka msanga,<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />mleke yaghalundike, lekeni iwanu wana ihaki watsoghapfala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:17">na iwalihela matotso watsegholela ifetsa yake.<verse eid="JOB 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />Ing'anda iyotsenga yeghala na utanda bui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:18">na ka chibumbulika ichitsengighwe na mbetetsi.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />Kowasa akuno katajili, lekeni ng'atsowasa keli apfo baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:19">na hayatsofumbula tsinenge tsake yalole, tsimali tsake tsose tsuka.<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />Ipfinu ipfimghela wogha pfomtsila ka matsi ghamemile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:20">na inyahemu yomsola nechilo kwa kwidukitsa.<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />Libeho lya mashaliki lyomghulusa, naye kakuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:21">lyomseya yakale kutali na hanu hake.<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />Imulungu katsomghulusa na libeho alyo bila kumwonela libatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:22">naye katsobama yatsume yahepe ingupfu yake lekeni ng'atsodaha baye.<verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />Iwanu watsomtowela makofi kwa ukumbetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:23">na watsomwowela yalawe hanu hake.<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu koitunya ihekima ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />Kuna hanu ghendo ha ukuhimba ghamabwe gha fetsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:1">na kuna hanu haihopfughighwa inzahabu.<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Ichuma chohimbighwa hasi mna lidongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:2">na ishaba yolubulighwa kulawa mna ghamabwe.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Iwohimba ghamabwe womwemwesa kwa itala mna ichisi totolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">wobama bama mbaka hasi hatali ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">na wohimba ghamabwe ighali mna ichisi totolo.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />Wohimba kutali na tsing'anda tsa iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">ako maghulu gha iwanu ng'ana ghang'e baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">wosang'ana kutali na iwanu aku wolebela mna imitsabi.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />Mna lidongo mumo mwachilawa ichijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:5">lekeni hasi ha lidongo chila chinu chotulighwa na ghumoto.<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />Mna ghamabambalawe ghake mwolawa mabwe gha bei ng'ulu ighokemighwa Yakuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:6">na litimbwisi lyake lyolapfa msanga ghwa nzahabu.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />Inzila ighenda ako kuduhu chideghe iyowinda iyoimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:7">wala inenge ya magengele ng'aiyona baye.<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />Wanyama wa kubagho iwoghenda kwa ukwighoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:8">ng'ana wang'e baye inzila ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:8">hata isimba ng'ana yang'e amwo baye.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />Iwanu iwohimba ghamabwe wohimba mna imibambalawe mikomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:9">woibomola imidunda kulawa hasi hayanzilile.<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />Wotula nzila mna imibambalawe mikulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:10">na tsinenge tsawo tsakona chila libwe lya bei ng'ulu.<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />Wokima ipfikolongo, ghamatsi ghaleke ukubita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:11">na wolapfa kunze ipfinu ipfipfisike.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />Lekeni ihekima kwaibamighwa kwani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:12">Na ukumanya kwakukala kwani?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />Kuduhu munu iyomanya ihekima iutsighwa bei yachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:13">wala ng'aikoneka baye mna isi yawokala iwali wagima.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />Ghamatsi ighaghendese gholonga, “Hekima ng'aili kuna nene baye,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:14">na ibahali yolonga, “Hekima ng'aili mghati mwangu baye.”<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />Wala ng'aighulighwa baye kwa nzahabu inoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:15">na bei yake ng'ailingighwa baye na ifetsa.<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />Wala ng'aighulighwa baye kwa nzahabu ya Ofiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:16">au kwa ghamabwe gha Shohamu na yakuti ighoutsighwa kwa bei ng'ulu.<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />Nzahabu au ghamabwe ighomeletseka ka chiyoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:17">ng'aghodaha baye kwighala nayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:17">na ina bei ng'ulu kubita ipfinu ipfitengenetsighwe kwa nzahabu inoghile.<verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />Ghamabwe gha Marijani na yasipi tuleke kughalonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:18">ihekima ina bei ng'ulu kubita ghendo libwe lya lulu.<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />Ghamabwe gha yakuti gha njano ighali gha bei ng'ulu kulawa Kushi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:19">ng'aghodaha baye kwighala na ihekima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:19">wala ihekima ng'aighulighwa baye kwa nzahabu ya bei ng'ulu.<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />Lelo ihekima kwailawa kwani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:20">Angu ukumanya kulawa kwani?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />Ihekima ipfisika mna tsinenge tsa chila chiumbe china ugima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:21">na ipfisika hata kwa ipfideghe iwali mlanga.<verse eid="JOB 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />Kutsimu na ukufa kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:22">“Tuhulika mbuli tsake kwa maghutwi ghetu.”<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />Imulungu yaliyeka komanya inzila ya ihekima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:23">na yuyo iyomanya kwaikala kwani.<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />Kwaapfila yeye kolola mbaka kwaitsighila isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:24">na kakona chila chinu chili hasi ha lilanga.<verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />Hayaling'ile libeho utito wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:25">na hayaghalingile ghamatsi,<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />hayailaghitse imvula pfaibamighwa ukutowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:26">na kulwikila nzila ilumwesa,<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />baho hayayone ihekima, kamanya ibei yake, na kaitangatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:27">kuya kaikaghula na kaighetsa.<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />Kuya Imulungu kamlongela imunu, “Ukumpfuka IMNDEWA yiyo ihekima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">na ukukala kutali na ighehile kuko ukumanya.”<verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu komalitsa ukulonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Ayubu kedika keli kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />Ng'apfu ning'awile ka ghumwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:2">imiyaka aila Imulungu hayang'ali yondolagha,<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />ahala hayang'ali yonimwemwesela itala yake mna litwi lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:3">nene tsanyanga mchisi kwa ghumwanga ghwake agho,<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />ka pfanikalile mna ghamtsuwa ghangu gha ukubweda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:4">ahala Imulungu hayakalile sale yangu mkulu mna ing'anda yangu,<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />aho Imulungu yana ingupfu hayang'ali yokala hamwe na nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:5">aku iwanangu wonitsunguluka.<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />Matsuwa agho imifugho yangu inga'li ilapfa matsiwa mengi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:6">na mitseituni yangu ing'ali ikula pfinoghile mna lidongo lya mabwemabwe.<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />Hang'endile kuna lilango kulu lya ghumji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:7">na kukala hanu hangu hana ichibwalu cha ukwitinganila,<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />iwasongolo hawambonile wang'ali wakwima mmbalimbali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:8">na iwabala iwakalile hasi wang'ali wakwinuka,<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />na iwakulu wang'ali woleka ukulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:9">aku wodiwa imilomo yawo kwa ghamoko ghawo.<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />Ipfilongotsi nawo tsawenyamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:10">aku milimi yawo inanahila mna imilomo yawo.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />Chila munu yanihulike, tsakanonga pfinoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:11">na ayula iyambonile i kanitoghola ghendo.<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />Kwaapfila tsanimkombola munu mhingwa iyanililile nimwapfile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:12">imchuwa, na ayula iyalihela munu wa kumwapfila.<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />Na ayula iyakalile habehi na ukufa tsakanibaliki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:13">na tsanighutenda ghumoyo ghwa ichitsuka ghwimbe kwa ukudeng'elela.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />Tsanitenda ighali gha ihaki ka gwanda lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:14">ukutenda ighanoghile kuwa ka lijoho lyangu na chilemba changu.<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />Nene ning'ali niwalongotsa ipfifita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:15">na ning'ali niwalongotsa ipfimbete,<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />tsaniwa aba wa iwanu wahingwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:16">nimwamila imgheni mna lighomba lyake.<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />Nitsibena tsingupfu tsa iwanu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:17">na niwaswekula awala iwaghoghighwe nawo.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />Baho nonga, ghamatsuwa ghangu ghatsakongetseka ka msanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:18">na nitsakufila mna ing'anda yangu,<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />nene tsaniwa ka mbiki, imitsitsi yangu ipfika kuna ghamatsi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:19">na litungwe likala chilo chose mna ghamaputila ghangu.<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />Ukulu wangu utsoghendelela kuwa wa sambi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:20">na tsingupfu tsangu tsitsakuwa ka minde ya sambi mna ghumoko ghwangu.<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />Iwanu tsawanihulikitsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:21">wenyamala tulu wahulike chaniwalongela.<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />Na hanimalitsa ukulonga wokala wahela cha kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:22">ghamalonga ghangu ghawengila ghendo mna ghamaghutwi ghawo.<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />Tsawanibetetsa ka munu iyobetetsa imvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:23">wabokela ghamalonga ka iwanu iwolima pfawobetetsa imvula ya kuhandila.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />Hawakalile watenyuka, nene niwasekela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:24">na hanisangalamke wawo wona chinu chikulu.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />Niwasaghulila inzila, na nene niwa chilongotsi wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">tsang'ala ka mfalume mna maasikali wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">niwa ka imunu iyowakanza iwanu iwodomboketsa.<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />Lekeni sambi iwanu woniseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">iwanu iwali wadodo ghendo kubita nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">hata aba tsawo ng'awabamighwe baye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">wekighwe hamwe na wambwa wangu iwokalitsa wang'olo wangu.<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />Angu ning'apatile choni kulawa mna tsingufu tsa ghamoko ghao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:2">iwanu wamalile tsingupfu?<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />Tsawasoka kwaapfila tsawana nzala ng'ani, na wahela chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:3">tsawatsunguluka nechilo mna isi isakale na ilihela chinu cha ukuja.<verse eid="JOB 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />Tsawabawa mitsani ya kubagho watenda chijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:4">waja mbaka imitsitsi ya imibiki.<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Tsawawingighwa wakale kutali na iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:5">na iwanu wawakemelela ka pfawokemelela imbapfi.<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />Tsawabamighwa wakale mna ipfikolongo ipfinyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:6">mna ghamapondo, na mna tsimango tsa ghamabambalawe.<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />Ako kubagho walila ka wanyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:7">na tsawelundika hamwe hana libagho.<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />Wao wana wa wabotsi na wana wa iwanu wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:8">wawingighwa kwa kufapulighwa walawe muisi.<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />Lelo sambi iwana wawo wonibetsa kwa kunyimbila wila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:9">na nene niwa munu wa ukusekighwa na wawo.<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />Wawo wonyihila, na wonihepa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:10">ng'awopfuka baye kunitemela ghamate mchihanga.<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />Kwaapfila Imulungu kanenda niwe nyondenyonde, na kanidununza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:11">nawo wonitendela ka apfila pfawobama.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />Kuna ghumoko ghwangu ghwa kujilo iwanu wonyinukila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">woninanahitsa nitsume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">wanibamila nzila tsa ukunikoma.<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />Woidiwa inzila yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:13">wakongetsa ghamaghayo ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:13">na kuduhu munu iyonyapfila.<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />Wonitsila ka wanu iwobita hanu hakulu habomoke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:14">wakutsa haghati ghati ha ghamahame wanitowe.<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />Nyingilighwa na wogha ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">ukulu wangu wose upfosa ka beho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">ukubweda kwangu kupfosa ka bingu.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />Na sambi nahabehi na ukuhupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:16">na matsuwa gha maghayo ghangogha.<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />Nechilo imipate yangu yose yonitama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:17">na usungu wanipata ng'auleka baye.<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />Kwa tsingupfu tsake, Imulungu kawa ka gwanda kuna nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:18">kanikwida ka isingo ya ligwanda lyangu.<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />Kanyasa mna likododo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:19">na nene niwa ka timbwisi na lipfu.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />Nokulilila ghweghwe Imulungu unyapfile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:20">lekeni ghweghwe ng'unyidika baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:20">nakwima nokulomba lekeni ghweghwe kondolesa hela.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />Ghweghwe kughaluka kuwa msughu kuna nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:21">konitowa kwa ghumoko ghwako ghuna ingupfu.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />Konyinula konighala kuchanya kuna libeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:22">konikunughitsa akuno na akuno mna inyahemu.<verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />Nomanya ghendo kongala kuna lifwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:23">hanu hawekilighwe iwanu wose wana ugima.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />Angu imunu iyoghaya ng'olomba yapfilighwe baye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:24">Na imunu iyodununzika pfihi ng'olomba baye wamwonele libatsi?<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />Angu nene siwalilile baye awala iwakalile mna ghamaghayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:25">na ghumoyo ghwangu ng'aghuwonele usungu baye iwanu iwahingwa?<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />Lekeni handolele nibokele ighanoghile, baho ighehile ghanitsila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">na hanibetetse mbone ghumwanga, baho ichisi chitsa.<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />Munda mwangu mtibuka, wala ng'amleka baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:27">na matsuwa gha maghayo ghanitsila.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />Nakwanga aku nolakala, lekeni si kwa tsuwa baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:28">nakwima hana ghumtingano, nolila nyapfilighwe.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />Nene nolila ka wambwa wa kumuhulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:29">na pfipfila nolila ka chimulu.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />Ngotsi yangu yobambuka bambuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:30">na mipate yangu yakwaka moto,<verse eid="JOB 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />ichinubi changu chiwa chinu ukudomboketsela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:31">na ifilimbi yangu iwa litsi lya ukudomboketsala.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />Nyika laghano na tsinenge tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:1">ndeke kumlolesa ipinga kwa ukumbama.<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />Angu choni chayekighwe imunu kulawa kwa Imulungu kuchanya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:2">Na choni chayolekelighwa imunu kulawa kwa Imulungu yana tsingupfu iyali kuchanya?<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />Angu si chililo baye ichiwatsila iwanu walihela ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:3">na si maghayo baye ighowalawila iwanu iwotenda ighehile?<verse eid="JOB 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />Angu yeye ng'okona baye ghose ghanitenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:4">pfihi ng'onilololesa baye chila hanighenda?<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />Ka nikala kwa kulonga ughutsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:5">na ka ng'ala kwa ukuwabugha iwanu,<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />mlekeni Imulungu yanilinge mna iminzani ilongesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:6">naye katsomanya ka nene nahela totso.<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />Ka ghumghulu ghwangu ghubaghuka ghuleka inzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">na ka ghumoyo ghwangu ghulongotsighwa na tsinenge tsangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">na ka ghamoko ghangu gheha kwa kutenda nzambi,<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />leka wanu wangi waje achila chanihandile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:8">na pfijo pfangu ipfili kumghunda wapfing'ole.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />Na ka ghumoyo ghwangu ghumbama ipinga wa munu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:9">au ka ning'ali nipfisa hana ghumlango ghwake,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />leka pinga wangu yamtwangile mmale yungi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:10">na wamale wangi wawase naye.<verse eid="JOB 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />Alyo ling'awile totso kulu ka tsanenda apfo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:11">nayo ing'awile nzambi ibamighwa kuhighighwa,<verse eid="JOB 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />kwaapfila inzambi ayo ing'awile ka moto ighulakatsa mbaka kutsimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:12">nagho ghung'alakatse pfinu pfangu pfose.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />Na ka tsaniwema aghala ghawobamighwa niweng'e watumwa wangu iwamale na iwapinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:13">ahala hawanililile wonilomba,<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />lelo nitsotenda choni ahala Imulungu hayatsakwinuka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:14">Nitsomwidika choni hayatsonitsila?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />Ayula iyaniumbile nene muinda mwa mame wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:15">ng'ambe yuyo iyawaumbile wawo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:15">Angu si yuyo yumwe baye iyatuumbile wose muinda mwa mai tsetu?.<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />Ka niwema iwahingwa chawabamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:16">na ka niwaleka pfitsuka wakale bila chakulolela,<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />ka ndiya chijo changu niliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:17">na sijile nawo baye iwachuwa,<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />lekeni nene kulawa usongolo wangu niwalela ka na aba wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:18">na kulawa udodo wangu niwalongotsa ipfitsuka.<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />Ka tsanimwona munu koghaya kwaapfila kahela gwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:19">au tsanimwona munu mhingwa kahela gholole lya ukwighubika,<verse eid="JOB 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />na simwing'ile baye ligwanda lya imighala ya ng'olo limtsumbuse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:20">na ghumoyo ghwake ghunongele mighede,<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />ka tsanimwonela imunu mchuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:21">akuno nomanya ka kuna wanu watsonyapfila kuna libalatsa,<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />leka liyegha lyangu lighojoke hanu hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:22">na ghumoko ghwangu ghubeneke hana ichifughumu chake.<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />kwaapfila tsanipfuka ghamaghayo igholawa kwa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:23">kwa ukupfuka ukulu wake nene sidahile baye ukutenda ipfinu apfo.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />Ka tsanyika lolelo lyangu mna inzahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:24">na niilongela inzahabu yelile, ghweghwe kwa hanu hangu ha ukutsumila,<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />ka tsanideng'elela tsimali tsangu pfatsili nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:25">atsila tsanipatile kwa ghumoko ghangu,<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />ka tsanilolesa litsuwa haling'ali likwalika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:26">na ghumwetsi hang'ungali ghoghenda aku ghong'ala,<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />akuno ghumoyo ghwangu chinyelenyele ghonongela niinamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:27">na ghumlomo ghwangu ghunonela ghamoko ghangu kwa kuitambikila,<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />Agho nagho ghang'awile nzambi ya ukuhighighwa na walamtsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:28">kwaapfila ning'oneke na mghutsu kwa Imulungu iyali kuchanya.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />Ka ning'adeng'elele apfila aduwi yangu pfayoghaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:29">na ka ning'onile pfinogha yeye kulawilighwa na ighehile,<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />ka silekile baye ukumlonga pfihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:30">kwa kumlighita yafe.<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />Ka iwanu wa ukaye yangu ng'awaghutsile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:31">nani ng'ana yeghute baye inyama?<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />Kuduhu mgheni iyawasile mnzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:32">kwaapfila imilango yangu ikala mwatsi kwa munu iyali mna ghumwanza.<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />Nene sitsipfisile nzambi tsangu ka wanu wamwenga pfawotenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:33">kwa kupfisa ighehile ghangu mmoyo mwangu.<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />Sipfukile baye ukwima hambele ha iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">wala sinyamale baye au kwihindila mng'anda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">kwa ukupfuka ukubetsighwa na iwanu.<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />Ka kung'awile na imunu wa kunitegheletsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">nene nelighita ka chila chinu chanilonga nolongesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">Imulungu yana tsingupfu yanyidike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">na awala iwonighalila ghamaghomba waghandike.<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />Aho ghendo ning'aghadutile mmayegha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:36">ning'aghekile mwitwi ka chilemba.<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />Ning'amlongele Imulungu chila chinu chanendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:37">ning'amsoghelele ka apfila namunu mkulu.<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />Ka isi yangu ing'anililile nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:38">na ghumghunda nagho ghung'alilile,<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />ka ndiya ipfijo pfake bila kuliha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:39">na kuwakoma iwenyegho,<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />leka imihonga yote hanu haikota ingano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">na mighughu yote hanu haikota ishayili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">Apfo Ayubu kamalitsa ukulonga.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="s">Elihu kolonga na Ayubu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOB 32:10-37:24">32:10–37:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />Apfo iwanu awala wadatu waleka ukumwidika Ayubu, kwaapfila tsakebona kahela totso mnange mwake imwenyegho. <verse eid="JOB 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />Apfo Elihu mwana wa Barakeli, munu wa Buzi iyolawa mna lukolo lwa Rama kamghudubukila Ayubu kwa kwibona mwenyegho kahela matotso na si Imulungu baye. <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />Pfipfila kawaghudubukila sale awala wadatu, kwaapfila ng'awalanguse baye chayatotsile Ayubu, lekeni wamhigha ka katotsa. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Elihu tsakabeta mbaka iwabala awo wadatu wamalitse kulonga na Ayubu kwaapfila yeye tsamdodo kubita wawo. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Baho Elihu hayonile iwanu awo wadatu wahela chinu cha ukumwidika Ayubu, kaghudubuka. <verse eid="JOB 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />Apfo Elihu imwana wa Barakeli, wa lukolo lwa Buzi, kanza kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">“Nene namsongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">mwemwe mlala, apfo tsanipfuka ukumlongelani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">sibamile baye kuwalongela achila chanimanya,<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />Nilongela mmoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:7">‘Waleke iwakalile matsuwa mengi walonge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:7">wana imiyaka mingi wafunde ihekima.’<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />Lekeni iloho ili mghati mwa imunu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:8">ghumuhe ghwa Imulungu yana tsingufu ghugho ighumwing'a ukumanya.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />Si wa iwanzehe waliyeka baye wana tsimbutsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:9">wala si awala baye wana imiyaka mingi waliyeka iwomanya chinu chachi chinoghile.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />Apfo nobama, mnitegheletse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:10">mndeke na nene nonge chanipfikitsa.<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />Nene tsanibetetsa hamng'ali mlonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">nihulikitsa aghala ghamlongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">ahala hamng'ali mbama bama cha ukulonga.<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />Niwahulikitsa ghoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">lekeni kuduhu hata munu yumwe mna mwemwe iyalanguse ka Ayubu katotsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">na kuduhu hata yumwe mna mwemwe iyedike ghayalongile Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />Na mleke ukulonga, ‘Tupata ihekima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">mlekeni Imulungu yalonge ka katotsa, na si imunu baye.’<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Ghayalongile Ayubu ng'anongile nene baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:14">na nene sitsomwidika baye ka pfammwidike mwemwe.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />Baho sale awala wadatu wakangawala, ng'awedike keli baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:15">nawo wahela cha ukulonga.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />Pfihi na nene nibetetse kwaapfila mwahela cha ukulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:16">mana mwinyamala tulu, mwahela cha ukwidika?<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />Nene pfipfila nitsolonga ghakwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:17">na nitsolonga chanimanya.<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />Kwapfila ninagho mengi gha ukulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:18">na iloho ili mghati mwangu yonikomangitsa nilonge.<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />Mghati mwangu niwa ka chikoba cha ngotsi chimemile dipfai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:19">ka chikoba cha ngotsi chimemile dipfai ya sambi chibama kutulika.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />Nolonga, ili chidogho mbone ng'apfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:20">nakwasama ghumlomo ghwangu nyidike.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />Sitsolola chihanga cha munu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:21">wala sibama imunu wowose yanitoghole baye.<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />Ka ning'abamile ukutogholighwa na iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:22">Imulungu wangu yang'asumke ukunyasa kutali.”<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />Elihu kaghendelela kulonga, “Lekeni sambi, Ayubu, tegheletsa ghamalonga ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:1">tegheletsa chila chinu chanilonga,<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />Lola, nakwasama ghumlomo ghwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:2">na ilulimi iluli mna ghumlomo ghwangu lulonge,<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />Ghamalonga ghangu gholawa mna ghumoyo ighunoghile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:3">na ghumlomo ghwangu ghwolonga aghala igholongesa ghanimanya.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />Iloho ya Imulungu iniumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:4">na ghumuhe ghwa Imulungu yana tsingupfu ghwongaya ugima.<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />Lelo nyidike, kama kodaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:5">ghubama kunongela gheke ghoya, kuya wime ulonge na nene.<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />Nene na ka ghweghwe hambele ha Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:6">nene pfifpfia niumbighwa kulawa mna lidongo.<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />Apfo uleke kunipfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:7">na ghanilonga ng'aghatsakuwa matito baye kuna ghweghwe,<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />Kulonga ghendo, na nene nikutegheletsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:8">nihulika ghose ghaulongile.<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />Ghweghwe tsakulonga, ‘Nene nyela, na nahela totso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:9">ninogha, na sina nzambi baye,<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />lekeni Imulungu kombona nene nitotsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:10">yeye kombona nene nomwihila.<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />Yeye koghoha ghamaghulu ghangu kwa iminyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:11">na kokaghula tsinzila tsangu kwa habehi.’<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />Lekeni nokulongela, mna alino ghweghwe kutotsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:12">kwaapfila Imulungu mkulu kubita munu wowose.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />Heule uhila naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:13">apfi ung'amghutsa ng'atsokwidika baye aghala ghaulonga?<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />Kwaapfila Imulungu kana nzila nyingi tsa ukulonga na iwanu, sambi kolonga kwa nzila imwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:14">hambele kolonga kwa nzila ingi, na imunu ng'omanya baye.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />Kolonga kubitila tsindoto, na mna ghamaono gha nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">nongo ndito hatsiwatsila iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">hawowasa mna ipfinanda pfawo.<verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />Baho yeye kopfughula ghamaghutwi ghao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:16">na kowaghela wogha iwanu ahala hayowakanya,<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />ili yawatende waleke ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:17">na kumwika kutali na ichidandali,<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />apfo komkinga imunu yaleke ukughenda kutsimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:18">na yaleke kukomighwa na lipanga.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />Imunu kofundighwa na usungu wayopata mna ilusatsi lwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:19">na kwa imipate yake ighendelela kutama bila kuleka,<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />nacho ichijo ng'achitsomnoghela baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:20">hata ichijo ichilimta chitsomdesa.<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />Ilukuli lwake lwosoka, na ng'alutangika keli baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:21">na imipate yake ipfisike yolawilila kunze.<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />Iloho yake yosoghela habehi na likabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:22">na yeye katsokala habehi na ukukomighwa.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />Ka kuna malaika habehi naye, iyoghombeletsa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">yumwe kulawa mna elufu imwe, wakumlongela imunu achila ichinoghile kuna yeye,<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />naye komwonela libatsi, komlongela Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">‘Mkombole yaleke kughenda kuna likabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">nene ninacho ichinu cha ukumkombola.’<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />Baho ilukuli lwake lutsodegheta ka lwa imwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:25">naye kakuya ka pfayakalile mna ghamatsuwa gha usongolo wake.<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />Kuya komlomba Imulungu, naye komtogholela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">kochona ichihanga cha Imulungu aku kosekelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">naye Imulungu komuyitsila imunu ihaki yake.<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />Yeye koghenda kwa iwanu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">‘Tsanenda nzambi, na nitenda aghala ighoneke gheha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">lekeni nene sihighighwe baye ka pfaibamighwe.<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />Imulungu kanikombola ndeke ukughenda kuna likabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:28">na nene nitsokala mgima, na kona ghumwanga.’<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />Imulungu kowatendela iwanu aghano</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:29">mala mbili, hata mala ndatu,<verse eid="JOB 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />ili yamkombole imunu yaleke ukufa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:30">na yone ghumwanga ghwa ugima.<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />Lelo, walangitse Ayubu, unitegheletse nene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:31">winyamale, nene nilonge,<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />ka kuna chinu cha ukulonga, unyidike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:32">ulonge kwaapfila nene nobama woneke kwahela totso,<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />lekeni ka kwahela cha ukulonga, nitegheletse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:33">winyamale, nikufunde ihekima.”<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="s">Elihu kaghendelela ukulonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />Kuya Elihu kaghendelela kulonga,<verse eid="JOB 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />Tegheghetseni chanilonga, mwemwe mna ihekima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:2">mnihulikitse nene mwemwe immanya.<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />Kwaapfila lighutwi lyohulikitsa ghamalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:3">ka ilulimi pfalulanza ichijo,<verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />Lelo twisaghulile iwenyegho aghala ighali ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:4">twifunde wenyegho aghala ighanoghile.<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />Kwaapfila Ayubu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:5">nene nahela totso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:5">lekeni Imulungu kanyima ihaki yangu,<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />Hata ka nahela totso, nakoneka namghutsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:6">na utamu wangu ng'auhoneka baye, hata ka sitotsile baye.<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />Angu kuna munu iyali ka Ayubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:7">iyombetsa Imulungu ka apfila kakunwa ghamatsi?<verse eid="JOB 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />Iyelongotsa na iwotenda ghehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:8">na iyakwanga hamwe na iwehile?<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />Kwaapfila yeye kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:9">imunu ng'obweda chinu baye, kwa kubama kumnoghelesa Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />Apfo nitegheletseni nene, mwemwe iwanu immanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">Imulungu ng'otenda baye ghehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">na Imulungu yana tsingupfu ng'ototsa baye.<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />Komliha imunu kwa kulola aghala ghayatendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:11">na komliha kwa kulola apfila pfayakalile.<verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />Nolongesa ghendo, Imulungu ng'otenda ghehile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:12">na Imulungu yana tsingupfu ng'akwaghisa baye ihaki.<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />Angu nani iyamsaghule Imulungu yalongotse isi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:13">Apfi nani iyamwikile yailole isi yose?<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />Ka Imulungu yang'abamile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:14">yang'asolile iloho yake, na ghumuhe ghwake ghwa ugima,<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />pfiumbe pfose pfing'afile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:15">na imunu naye yang'oyile mna litimbwisi.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />Ka kuna tsimbutsi, uhulike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:16">utegheletse chanilonga.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Pfihi ayula iyakwihila ihaki kodaha ukutawala?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:17">Angu kutsomhigha ayula iyali na ihaki na iyana tsingupfu?<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />Angu pfinogha kumlongela mfalume, ghweghwe ng'uli munu ghendo baye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:18">Au kumlongela munu mkulu, “Ghweghwe kwiha?”<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />Lelo pfihi kwa ayula ing'ayolola baye ipfihanga pfa iwakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">wala ng'owapfikitsa baye iwanu matajili kubita iwanu iwahingwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">kwaapfila awo wose sang'ano tsa ghamoko ghake.<verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />Wakufa kwa ukwidukitsa, kuchilo ghati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">iwanu wohighisighwa na wohupa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">wana ingupfu wobulighwa bila ghumoko ghwa munu.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />Kwaapfila tsinenge tsake tsolola aghala ghawotenda iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:21">yeye kolola apfila iwanu pfawokala.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />Haduhu hanu hatitu, wala hana ichisi totolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:22">iwanu wehile hawodaha ukughenda wakepfise.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />Kwapfila yeye ng'olonga baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:23">tsuwachi imunu yaghende yakamhighe.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />Kowahonda honda iwanu wana tsingupfu aku ng'oghutsa baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:24">na koweka wanu wangi wasole hanu hao.<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />Kwaapfila yeye komanya ghose ghawotenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:25">naye kowabidula nechilo, nawo wohupa ghendo.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />Yeye kowatowa kwaapfila watenda ghehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:26">aku chila munu kolola,<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />kwaapfila tsawahundukila kungi, waleka kumuwinza yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:27">na watsibetsa tsinzila tsake.<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />Nawo watenda ichililo cha iwanu wahingwa chimpfikile yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:28">naye kahulika ichililo cha iwanu awo iwodununzighwa.<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />Ka yeye yang'enyamala tulu, angu nani iyodaha kumhigha?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">Ka yeye yang'apfisa uhanga wake, apfi nani iyodaha kumwona</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">hata ing'awa wanu wengi au munu yumwe?<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />Kotenda apfo ili imunu yehile yaleke kutawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:30">au kowatenda waleke kuwaghalila iwanu ghamaghayo.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />Tulonge imunu komlongela Imulungu apfino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:31">Nene nitotsa, lekeni sitsotenda nzambi keli baye.<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />Nifunde aghala nene sighona baye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:32">na ka nitenda ghehile, sitsotenda keli baye.<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />Angu Imulungu katsomtowa ka pfaubama ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">mbaka ughaleme agho?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">Kobamighwa ghweghwe ulamle, wala si nene baye wa ukulamla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">apfo ulonge achila chaumanya.<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />Iwanu wana tsimbutsi watsonongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:34">na chila imunu iyana ihekima iyonihulikitsa nene katsolonga,<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />Ayubu kolonga bila kumanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:35">chayolonga ubotsi uliyeka<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />Ng'apfu Ayubu yang'aghetsighwe mbaka twone kwayotsighila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:36">kwaapfila kakwidika ka iwanu iwehile,<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />Kwaapfila kakongetsa ghehile mna tsinzambi tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">kotubetsa kwa kututowela ghamakofi, kwa ukumlonga pfihile Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="s">Elihu koghendelela ukulonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Kuya Elihu kaghendelela kulonga,<verse eid="JOB 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />Angu ghweghwe kwakona alino linogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:2">kolonga, “Nene nahela totso, lekeni Imulungu kana totso.”<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />Naghwe koghutsa, “Angu chanibweda choni na chanipata choni kwa ukuleka kutenda nzambi?”<verse eid="JOB 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />Lelo nene nokwidika ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:4">hamwe na sale tsako.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />Ulole kulanga na wone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:5">lola ghamabingu pfaghali kutali kuchanya kubita ghweghwe.<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />Ka kotenda nzambi, angu yeye umtendile choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:6">Na ka tsinzambi tsako tsongetseka, yeye umtendele choni?<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />Ka ghweghwe kwahela matotso, apfi ghweghwe umwing'a choni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:7">au yeye yobokela choni kulawa kuna ghumoko ghwako?<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />Ighehile ghautenda ghodaha kumlagha imunu iyali ka ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:8">na ighanoghile ghautenda ghodaha ukumwapfila imunu.<verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />“Iwanu wolila ahala hawodununzighwa sideke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:9">wolomba wapfilighwe walawe mna ghumoko ghwa imunu yana ingupfu.<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />Wala kuduhu yolonga, ‘Yalikwani Imulungu, iyali Maumba wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:10">yeye iyonenda nimbe tsiwila nechilo,<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />iyotufunda pfinu pfingi kubita wanyama wali muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:11">iyotutenda tukengele kubita wapfideghe wali mlanga.’<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />Yeye ng'akwidika baye iwanu hawolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:12">kwaapfila iwanu awo wehile wana chidandali.<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />Imulungu ghendo ng'otegheletsa baye chililo chao cha hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:13">Imulungu yana tsingupfu ng'akwalangitsa baye ichililo ka acho.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />Lelo yokwidikatse ka ghweghwe mwenyegho kolonga ng'umwona baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:14">akuno lighomba lyako lya hambele hake, naghwe kombetetsa yeye!<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />Pfipfila kolonga, ka yeye ng'otutowa baye kwa imaya yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:15">na yeye ng'owalangula baye iwanu ahala hawototsa.<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />Apfo Ayubu koghendelela kulonga pfinu pfa ubotsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:16">kalonga pfinu pfingi aku ing'apfimanyile baye.”<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="s">Elihu kaghendelela ukulonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Kuya Elihu kaghendelela ukulonga,<verse eid="JOB 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />Unidudumile chidogho, nikulanguse chinu chimwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:2">kwaapfila nina chinu cha ukukulongela kulawa kwa Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />Ukumanya kwangu nikupata kulawa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:3">na nene nitsolangusa imuumba wangu pfayali na ihaki,<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />Nolongesa ghendo, chanilonga si cha ughutsu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:4">na iyenelel mna ukumanya ipfinu ka hamwe naghwe.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />Imulungu kana ngupfu, lekeni ng'ombetsa imunu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:5">yeye kana ngupfu ng'ulu ya ukumanya apfinu.<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />Ng'owaleka baye iwanu wehile waghendelele kuwa wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:6">lekeni yeye koweng'a awala iwodununzighwa ihaki yawo.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />Tsinenge tsake ng'atsileka baye kuwalola iwanu wana ihaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">naye koweka mna ipfighoda pfa chifalume wakale hamwe na iwafalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">kuya kowenula matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />Ka iwanu wohighwa na iminyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:8">na waghaya kwa aghala ghawatendile,<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />yeye kowalangusa aghala ghawatendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:9">ka watenda nzambi kwa ichidandali chawo.<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />Yeye koghatenda ghamaghutwi ghao ghahulike aghala ghawokanyighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:10">na kowalaghitsa woye kulawa mna ukutenda ighehile.<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />Wang'amteghetsa Imulungu na ukumsang'anila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">matsuwa ghao ighakalile watsokala kwa ukubweda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">na imiyaka yawo yakuwa ya ukudeng'elela.<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Lekeni ka ng'awatsotegheletsa baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:12">watsokomighwa na lipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:12">watsakufa aku ng'awomanya chinu baye.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />Iwanu ing'awompfuka Imulungu, wakwika imaya mna imimoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:13">ng'awomlilila yawapfile baye ahala hayowoha.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />Wakufa wang'ali wasongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:14">na ugima wao wohupa hawali haghatighati ha iwehile.<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />Lekeni kwa awala iwoghaya, yeye kowakombola kulawa mna ghamaghayo ghao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:15">na mna ghamaghayo agho kolonga nawo wammanye yeye.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />Yeye kokulongotsa ulawe mmaghayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">ukale hanu henelele, bila kwibanya banya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">na imetsa yako ya ukujila imeme ipfijo pfinoghile.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />Lekeni sambi kohighighwa ka imunu iyehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:17">naghwe kughoghighwa na kuhighighwa ka pfaibamighwa.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />Walangitse imaya ileke kukutenda ubetse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:18">na ukongetseka kwa tsimali tsako kuleke kukwaghisa.<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />Pfihi tsimali tsako au tsingupfu tsako tsose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:19">tsodaha kukulapfa mna ghamaghayo?<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />Uleke kulolela ichilo chingile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:20">kwaapfila nechilo iwanu woghoghighwa kulawa mna tsing'anda tsawo.<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />Walangitse uleke kwingila mna ighehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:21">kwaapfila ghweghwe kusaghula ghehile kubita ghamaghayo.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />Imulungu kenulighwa mna tsingupfu tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:22">nani iyali mlangulitsi ka yeye?<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />Nani iyamlongotse cha ukutenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:23">au iyodaha kumlongela, ghweghwe kutotsa?<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />Uleke kwisemwa kughatunya aghala ghayatendile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:24">aghala iwanu ghawembile mna tsiwila.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Iwanu wose waghona ghayatendile Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:25">nawo waghona kulawa kutali.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />Lola Imulungu pfayali mkulu, kubita ghendo tsimbutsi tsetu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:26">Na imiyaka yake ng'aimanyika baye.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />Yeye kokwegha kuchanya mpuke ghwa ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:27">kuya koghutenda ghuwe mvula itowa muisi,<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />na mabingu gholopfa imvula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:28">nayo yowatowela iwanu wose.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />Angu nani yomanya pfayakwanzatsa ghamabingu mlanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:29">Na apfila pfayodumilila kulawa akula kwayokala Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />Yeye kakwenetsa ilumwesa lwake lumtsunguluke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:30">lekeni koleka hanu haghendese hasi ha ibahali hawe chisi.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />Apfi pfipfo pfayowahigha iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:31">naye kowenga ichijo bwelele.<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />Ilumwesa kolumemesa mna ghamoko ghake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:32">na kolulaghitsa lutowe ahala hayobama.<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />Ukuduma kwake kolonga yeye pfayali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:33">na wanyama womanya ukutsa kwake.<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />Elihu kaghendelela ukulonga, Kwa mdumo aghuno ghumoyo ghwangu ghwoghudema kwa ukupfuka,<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Tegheletseni Imulungu pfayoduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:2">na ukuduma ukulawa mna ghumlomo ghwake,<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />Koleka lumwesa lwake lwenele mlanga mwose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:3">na kolughala mna chila hanu haitsighila isi.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />Ukupulika hakumala, Imulungu koduma kwa litsi lya ukulu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">na hayoduma keli, koluleka ilumwesa lupulike keli.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />Imulungu hayodumilila kolapfa litsi lya kukangawatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:5">yeye kotenda makulu kubita ghendo tsimbutsi tsetu pfatsimanya.<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />Kwaapfila koilongela ibalafu, “Ughwe muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:6">pfipfila koghalongela ghamawagha gha imvula, Towa mvula ng'ulu.”<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />Kowatenda iwanu weme ukusang'ana tsing'onde tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:7">ili chila munu iyamuumbile yatange chayatendile Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />Kuya wanyama woghenda kwipfisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:8">wokala mna tsimango tsawo.<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />Inyahemu yoduma kulawa hanu hake haikwanzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:9">na ichipfeghetsi cholawa mna libeho liduma.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />Ghumuhe ghwa Imulungu ghoghala ibalafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:10">na hanu hakulu ha ghamatsi hogandilila.<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />Koghatenda ghamabingu ghameme ghamawagha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:11">na ilumwesa lopulika kulawa mna ghamabingu agho.<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />Naye koghalongotsa ghamabingu ghatsunguluke akuno na akuno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">mchanya mwa isi yawokala iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">ghadahe ukutenda chochose chayolaghitsa.<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />Yeye koghala ghamabingu ili ghawatowe iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">au ghaghale imvula mna isi yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">na ghalangusa uluso wake kwa iwanu.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />Ghwe Ayubu tegheletsa alino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:14">winyamale tulu, utegheletse tsing'onde tsa ukungawatsa tsa Imulungu.<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />Apfi komanya Imulungu pfayoghalongotsa ghamabingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:15">na pfoyotenda lumwesa lwake luli mna ghamabingu lwake?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />Angu komanya ghamabingu pfaghokala tulu mlanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:16">Atso ng'onde tsa ukukangawatsa tsa ayula iyenele mna ukumanya.<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />Ghamagwanda ghaupfalile ighokutenda utsumbuke ghatsokudesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:17">ahala libeho ilisoma kulawa kusini halitsoduma mna isi.<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />Pfihi kodaha kulitandatsa lilanga hamwe naye</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:18">na kulitenda liwe komu ka chiyoo cha ishaba isughuligghwe?<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />Ayubu utufunde achila chatutsomlongela Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:19">twetwe twahela cha ukulonga naye kwaapfila twetwe twa mchisi, ng'atumanya chinu baye.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />Angu nimlongele Imulundu ka nobama kulonga naye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:20">Apfi kuna munu iyolomba yafe?<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />Lelo kuduhu munu iyodaha kululola litsuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">apfila pfaling'aika kulanga, ahala libeho halidumile na kughawinga ghamabingu.<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />Imulungu kakutsa kulawa kasikazini aku kong'ala ka nzahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:22">yeye kakutsa mna mg'alo ighututenda tupfuke.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />Ng'atudaha baye kupfika kwa Imulungu yana tsingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">Yeye kamkulu na kana ngupfu ng'ulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">kotenda ighali gha ihaki, naye ng'omuwoneya munu baye.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />Apfo iwanu wompfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:24">kwaapfila yeye ng'owalangula baye awala iwebona wana hekima mmoyo.<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu komwidika Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />Baho Imulungu kamwidika Ayubu mna chipfulapfumbi, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />“Angu nani ayuno iyopfulaghitsa ghanilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:2">iyolonga bila kumanya?<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />Wiyohe mchuno ka kwa mmale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:3">nene nitsokughutsa, naghwe unyidike.<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />Ghweghwe tsauli kwani nene hanyikile ghumsingi ghwa isi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:4">Nongele ka komanya.<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />Angu nani iyalingile utali wake, ghweghwe kommanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:5">au nani iyagholose lutsabi yailinge?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Apfi imisingi yake ikighwe mchanya mwa chinu chachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:6">nani iyekile libwe ilikala hana imembe,<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />ahala tsinondo tsa nemitondo hatsing'ali tsakwimba hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:7">na ahala iwana wose wa Imulungu hawakemelele kwa kudeng'elela?<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />Au nani iyahindile bahali imilango yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:8">ahala haitulike kulonga ilawa munda<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />ahala hanitendile libingu liwe gwanda lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:9">na niitsungulusila chisi chikulu,<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />ahala hanikile imibaka kutsunguluka ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:10">na hanyikile ghamalango ghake na tsikomeo,<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />na kuilongela, ‘Kotsigha ahano, na si ako baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:11">na mawimbi ghako ghana ingupfu ghatsitsighila ahano?’<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />Angu tangu woneke tsakulaghitsa imitondo ilawile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:12">na kululaghitsa lupfilipfili lulangale?<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />Ili mitondo ayo yenele mbaka akula kwaitsighila isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:13">na kuwakulupusa iwanu wehile watsume?<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Isi yakoneka ghoya ka apfila ipfatsighwa gwanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:14">na ka chitango chikighwe mna lidongo lya widi lifinighwe.<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />Iwanu wehile ghumwanga ng'awoghubama baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:15">kwaapfila ghowaghoma waleke ukutenda ighehile.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />Angu ma kupfika kuna tsimbwibwi tsa ibahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:16">au tsakwanga hasi haghendese ha ibahali?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />Pfihi mala wakulangusa ghamalango gha lifwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:17">mala tsakona ghamalango gha kutsimu?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />Pfihi komanya ukulu wa isi pfauli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:18">Longa ka komanya agha ghose.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />Ilikwani inzila ya ukupfika akula kwaghukala ghumwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:19">na kwani kwachikala ichisi?<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />Angu kodaha kupfisola na kupfighala ako kwapfikalagha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:20">na udahe kutanga inzila ya ukughenda ako?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />Ghweghwe komanya ghendo, kwaapfila koneka mwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:21">naghwe kukala miyaka mingi.<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />Pfihi mala kwingila mna ikano ya ibalafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:22">au mala kuyona ikano ya imvula ya ghamabwe,<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />ghanighekile ghatse mna ghamatsuwa gha ghamaghayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:23">na mna ghamatsuwa gha ing'ondo na ukwitowa?<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Ilikwani inzila ighenda hanu ahala ghumwanga haghugholighwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:24">au ako kwalilawa libeho lya mashaliki na kwenela muisi?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />Angu nani iyekile ipfikolongo pfa ghamatsi gha imvula?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:25">Nani iyalulanguse ilumwesa inzila yake mna ghamabingu,<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />itenda imvula itowe mna isi ing'aikalighwa na munu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:26">na kuna lijangwa lilihela munu,<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />ili isi isakale na ikalile uchuwa yenele ghamatsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:27">na imitsani yote mna isi ayo?<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />Apfi imvula ina aba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:28">Angu aba wa ghamadone gha ilitungwe nani?<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />Angu ibalafu ilawila muinda mwa nani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:29">Nani iyeleke ng'ungughu ya kulanga?<verse eid="JOB 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />Ghamatsi ghakuwa makomu ka libwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:30">na uhanga wa ibahali woganda.<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />Angu kodaha koha hamwe tsinondo tsa chilimia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:31">na kuleghetsa imitsabi ya tsinondo tsa Orioni.<verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />Pfhi kodaha kughalongotsa tsinondo itsikala chifumvughulu mna imisimu yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:32">au kodaha kumlongotsa imnyama iyokemighwa dubu hamwe na iwanaghe?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />Pfihi kughamanya malaghitso igholongotsa lilanga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 38:33">Angu kodaha kughatenda ghamalaghitso agho ghalongotse mna isi?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />Kodaha kukemelela mbaka uhulikike kuna ghamabingu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:34">Mbaka ghalapfe ghamatsi ghakuhulumkile?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />Pfihi kodaha kulutuma ilumwesa, nalwo lughende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:35">na kuya lukulongele, ‘Twetwe twa ahano’?<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />Angu nani iyekile ihekima mna iwanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:36">nawo womanya ipfinu kwa tsimbutsi tsawo?<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />Angu nani iyana tsimbutsi tsa ukupeta ghamabingu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:37">Apfi nani iyodaha kwinamitsa ghamabigha gha ghamatsi gha imvula ighali kulanga?<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />Ighotenda litimbwisi ligande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:38">na lidongo liwe kododo.<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39" />Kodaha kumuwingila isimba pinga mawingo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:39">au kuwatenda simba wadowado wana inzala weghute,<verse eid="JOB 38:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40" />hawepfisa mna tsimango tsawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:40">au hawowasa kubagho wapfisile?<verse eid="JOB 38:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />Angu nani iyomwing'a ibondwa ichijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">iwanaghe hawonililila nene Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">na kwanga ako na ako kwaapfila wahela chaukuja?”<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />Angu komanya iwamene wa kupfidunda wakweleka tsuwachi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:1">Angu mala kumwona idondolo hayakweleka iwanaghe?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />Angu kodaha kupeta imiyetsi yao mbaka hawakweleka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:2">Apfi komanya imisimu yawo ya ukweleka?<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />Wakwinama wakweleka iwana wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:3">na usungu wao wa ukweleka womala.<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />Iwana wawo wokula na wakongetseka tsingupfu kuko kubagho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:4">kuya wakuka kutali, na ng'awakuya keli baye.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />Nani iyamlekelele chihongwe wa kubagho yoke?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:5">Nani iyamdohole imitsabi yake?<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />Ayula yanimwing'ile lijangwa liwe kaye yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:6">na isi ya munyu iwe hanu hake ha ukukala.<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />Yeye kokala kutali na ghumji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:7">wala ng'ohulika baye ukukemelela kwa mwimilitsi.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />Kakwanga kwanga mpfidunda kobama ichijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:8">na kobama bama imitsani mibisi yaje.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />Pfihi mbogho kodaha kutoghola yakusang'anile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:9">Na pfihi kodaha kukala hawowasa wanyama wako?,<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />Apfii kodaha kumwoha lutsabi mbogho yalime?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:10">Au yeye kodaha kulima ghumghunda aku kakuchughu kwako?<verse eid="JOB 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />Angu kwitsemuhuwila yeye kwaapfila kana ngupfu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:11">Au ing'onde yako kutsomlekela yeye?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />Pfihi kutsomlolela yaghale ipfijo ukaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:12">na yaghale ipfijo apfo hana ichibwalu cha ukubetela?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />Ghamabawa gha ichideghe mbuni ghepamana kwa ukwighoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:13">lekeni ng'aghodaha baye kwighala na ghamabawa gha ichideghe kolongo iyana imighala,<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />kwaapfila imbuni kopfisa mafinga ghake hasi ha lidongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:14">na koghaleka ghatsumbuke mna ghumsanga,<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />lekeni kesemwa ghengo ka mghulu ghwodaha kughatula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:15">au mnyama wa kubagho kodaha kughabajugha.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />Imbuni kowatendela ukali iwanaghe, ka apfila si wake baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:16">hata ing'onde yake ing'awa hela yeye kakona si chinu baye,<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />kwaapfila Imulungu kamwima ihekima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:17">wala ng'amwing'ile baye tsimbutsi.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Yeye hayepamana ghamabawa ghake yatsume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:18">komseka ghendo ifalasi na ayula iyamdinile.<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />Angu ghweghwe yuyo yumwing'a ifalasi tsingupfu tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:19">au ghweghwe yukwika imighala mitali ihighisika mna isingo yake?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />Pfihi ghweghwe yumtendile yaghuluke ka nzighe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:20">Na yeye hayolila koghela wogha.<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />Yeye kopalula palula lidongo kunyika, na kodeng'elela tsingupfu tsake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:21">hayoghenda kwitingana na wana tsisilaha.<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />Kouseka wogha aku yeye ng'opfuka chinu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:22">wala ng'akuya kuchughu baye hayolyona lipanga.<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />Iyala ya ukwikila imishale yomwasukila ifalasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:23">hamwe na ghumgoha na limaghe ilimeletseka.<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />Yeye kotsuma aku kohighisika na kaghudubuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:24">wala ng'akwima baye ahala imalati hailtowighwa.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />Na imalati hailila, kolonga Aha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">na kohulika ing'ondo pfainung'a kulawa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">kohulika walongotsa ng'ondo pfawokemelela.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />Pfihi tsimbutsi tsako tsiso tsimfundile ichitema kughuluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:26">akuno ghabawa ghake ghopamanika yaghuluke yaghende kusini?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />Angu ghweghwe yumlaghitsa magengele yaghuluke mchanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:27">na yatsenge ichibali chake kuchanya? <verse eid="JOB 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />Yeye kokala mna ghamabambalawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:28">na mumo kotenda iwe kaye yake.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />Kulawa kuko kobama ichijo chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:29">na tsinenge tsake tsakona chayowinda kulawa kutali.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />Na iwanaghe nawo wakunwa idamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:30">na kuna ghumtsogha yeye kuko kwayali.<verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Ayubu,<verse eid="JOB 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />Angu imunu iyesonga na Imulungu yana ing'upfu kodaha komlonga Imulungu katotsa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:2">Leka ayula iyomwona Imulungu katotsa yamwidike.<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Baho Ayubu kamwidika IMNDEWA, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />Nene sili chinu ghendo baye, nikwidika choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:4">Nodiwa ghumlomo ghwangu na ghumoko.<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />Tsanonga mala lumwe, na sitsakwidika baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:5">tsanonga lwakeli, lekeni sitsoghendelela keli baye.<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamwidika Ayubu kulawa mna ichipfulapfumbi, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />Wime lelo, ka ghweghwe kwa mmale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:7">nikughutse, naghwe unyidike.<verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />Pfihi ghweghwe kolema apfila pfanikuhighile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:8">Angu kombona nene nitotsa, ghweghwe ng'utotsile baye?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />Pfihi ghweghwe kuna ngupfu ka nene Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:9">na kodaha kuduma ka nene?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />Lelo wighubike ghumwenyegho ukung'ala na iheshima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:10">na wipfatse ukutogholeka na utunitso.<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />Ulanguse apfila imaya yako pfaili ng'ulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:11">umlole chila munu yana ichidandali na umhulumse,<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />umlole chila munu iyeghoda, umughwise hasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:12">na uwabajughe iwanu wehile baho hawakwima.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />Wose uwatsike hamwe mtimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:13">pfihanga pfao upfipfise mna likabuli.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Babo hanitsokutambula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:14">ka tsingupfu tsako mwenyegho tsodaha kukukombola.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />Umlole ichiboko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">nene nimuumba ka apfila pfanikuumbile ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">iyakuja mitsani ka ng'ombe.<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />Lola, tsingupfu tsake tsili mchuno mwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:16">na lola tsinyughe tsake tsili mna lida pfatsili na ngupfu.<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />Kohighisa ghumkila ghwake ka mbiki ghwa mweletsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:17">na tsinyughe tsili mna ghamahatsa ghake tsilungighwa hamwe,<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />imipate yake ka mibomba ya shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:18">na tsimbapfu tsake ka pfibao pfa chuma.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />Yeye kawakwanza mna ipfinu pfayaumbile Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:19">yeye iyamuumbile yuyo iyodaha kumghendela na lipanga.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />Pfidunda pfomghalila ipfijo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:20">ako iwanyama wa kubagho wodawala.<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />Wowasa hasi mna libagho lya imihonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:21">wepfisa mna imidete ili mlwanda mna ichitsapfa.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />Imidete ayo yomghubika kwa chimbeho chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:22">na imibiki ikota mmbalimbali mwa ipfikolongo yomtsunguluka.<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Ghumto haghumema ghamatsi, yeye ng'oghudema baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:23">kokala tulu, hata ghamatsi gha ghumto Yoridani ghang'amema ghapfike mna ghumlomo ghwake.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />Angu kuna munu iyodaha kumghogha aku kolola kwa tsinenge tsake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:24">Au kodaha kumwonza mna ghumtegho kwa ukumtobola imula yake?<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />“Pfihi kodaha kumkwegha imanyama iyokemighwa Leviathani na indoano?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:1">Au pfihi kodaha kumwoha kwa lutsabi ilulimi lwake?<verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />Pfihi kodaha koha lutsabi mna imula yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:2">au kutobola matsino ghake kwa indoano?<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />Angu katsokudedetsa umwonele libatsi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:3">Pfihi katsolonga naghwe lughalugha?<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />Apfi katselaghana na ghweghwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:4">umsole yawe mtumighwa wako matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa?<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />Angu kutsodawala naye ka chideghe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:5">apfi kodoha kumwoha lutsabi na wandele wako wadawale naye?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Pfihi iwanu iwopfula wasomba watsomchulutsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:6">au watsomgana na kuwagholela wachulutsi?<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Pfihi kodaha kuitobola ingotsi yake kwa ukumhoma migoha mingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:7">au kutobola litwi lyake kwa migoha ya kupfulila wasomba.<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />Umwikile ghumoko ghwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:8">naghwe kutsokumbuka ghendo ing'ondo itsolawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:8">na ng'utsakuyila keli baye ukutenda apfo.<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />Imunu iyololela kumghogha ayo koghutsuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:9">na kumwona kuliyeka komlaghasa imunu hasi.<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />Kuduhu iyali mkali wakumghobola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:10">Lelo nani iyodaha kwima hambele yangu?<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />Mna ghumlomwo ghwake mwolawa imilambi ya ghumoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:11">na tsisesi tsa ghomoto tsoghuluka kunze.<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />Sitsenyamala baye ukulonga mbuli tsa pfiungo pfake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:12">na tsingupfu tsake pfatsili nyingi na liumbo lyake linoghile.<verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />Nani iyodaha kumpalula magamba ghake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:13">Apfi nani iyodaha kumsoghelela na chinu cha ukumwendesela ichikemighwa lijamu?<verse eid="JOB 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />Angu nani iyodaha kupfughula ghumlomo ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:14">ighutsungulusighwe ghamatsino ighoghela wogha?<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />Yeye keghodela ghamagamba ghake ighakalile mna imisululu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:15">nagho ghekindilisa hamwe.<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />Chila gamba limwe likindilitsa na liyaghe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:16">mbaka libeho ng'alidaha baye kubita haghatighati hao.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />ghohighwa pfinoghile hamwe, tsinanahila hamwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:17">kuduhu chinu ichidaha kughaghola.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />Yang'atowa miyesa kolapfa ghumwanga ighumeletseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:18">tsinenge tsake ka miyale ya lutsuwa lwa nemitondo tondo.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Milambi ya moto yolawa mna ghumlomo ghwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:19">na sesi tsa ghumoto tsoghulukila kunze.<verse eid="JOB 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />Yosi lyolawa mna tsimula tsake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:20">ka ghumpfuke ighulawa mna ichiha ichitoghota ichikighwe mchanya mwa midete ikwaka.<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Ghumuhe ghwake ghwobwina ghumoto ghwa ghamakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:21">na milambi ya ghumoto yolawa mna ghumlomo ghwake.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />Tsingupfu tsokala mna isingo yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:22">chila hayoghenda yeye koghela wogha.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />Tsinyama tsibingilike tsa ilukuli lwake tsinanahila hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:23">tsinanahila hamwe, ng'atsitsoseghela baye.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />Imambagha yake ikomala ka libwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:24">na ng'omu ka libwe lya hasi lya ukusaghila.<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />Yeye hayakwinuka, wana ingupfu wopfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:25">wakuya kuchughu kwa wogha wao.<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />Imunu yang'amwasila lipanga, ng'alimlagha baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:26">ghuwe mgoha au limaghe.<verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27" />Ichuma yeye kochona ka tsani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:27">na shaba yeye koyona ka biki lyolile.<verse eid="JOB 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28" />Ghumshale ng'aghudaha baye kumtenda yatsume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:28">na ghamabwe gha ing'umbewe yeye koghona ka mibangu.<verse eid="JOB 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29" />Ichilungu yeye kochona ka beleghe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:29">naye koseka hayohulika ghumsindo ghwa ghumgoha ighukwasighwa.<verse eid="JOB 41:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30" />Hasi ha lida lyake kweghala na pfihali ipfitema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:30">hayobita kokwalutsa hasi na koleka pfitango mna likododo.<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31" />Yeye koitenda ibahali ifoke ka chiya cha ghamatsi ichitoghota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:31">koihighisa ibahali ka chiya cha mapfuta ighonung'ila ghoya,<verse eid="JOB 41:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32" />Hayobita kuchughu kwake koleka mbulutso ighung'ala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:32">na munu kodaha kulonga ka ibahali ina mvili nzelu.<verse eid="JOB 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33" />Muisi kuduhu iyeghala naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:33">iyaumbighwe bila kuwa na wogha.<verse eid="JOB 41:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34" />Yeye kolola chila chinu ichikwinuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:34">yeye kamfalume kwa wose wana ichidandali.”<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Kuya Ayubu kamwidika IMNDEWA, kalonga,<verse eid="JOB 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />“Nomanya ghendo ghweghwe kodaha kutenda chila chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:2">na chochose chaubama chitendeke kuduhu iyodaha kuchighoma.<verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />Naghwe kughutsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">'Angu nani ayuno iyakwingilila mbuli tsangu bila kumanya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">Nonga ghendo pfinu apfila nene sipfimanyile baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">pfinu apfo pfonikangawatsa ghendo, na nene sipfimanyile baye.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />Tsakunongela apfino, ‘Sambi tegheletsa, na nene nitsolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:4">nene nitsokughutsa, naghwe unyidike.’<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />Tsanikuhulika kwa maghutwi ghangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:5">lekeni sambi nokona kwa tsinenge tsangu.<verse eid="JOB 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />Apfo sambi nene nebona si chinu ghendo baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:6">na notoghola ka nitotsa, lelo nebakatsa lipfu na litimbwisi.”<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chitabu Chomala apfino</para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />IIMNDEWA hayamalitse ukulonga na Ayubu, kamlongela Elifazi, munu wa Temani, “Nikughudubukila ghweghwe na sale tsako weli, kwaapfila mwemwe ng'amlongese baye mna tsimbuli tsangu, ka pfayalongile imtumighwa wangu Ayubu. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />Apfo soleni ng'ombe wamale saba na ng'olo wamale saba na mghende kwa imtumighwa wangu Ayubu, na mwikelapfile tsinambiko tsa ukulakasighwa. Mtumighwa wangu Ayubu katsomlombelani, nitsohulika chayolomba, na nene sitsowatendela baye kwa kulola ubotsi wenu, kwaapfila ng'amlongile baye aghala igholongesa ka mtumwa wangu Ayubu pfayalongile.” <verse eid="JOB 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Apfo Elifazi iyolawa Temani, Bildadi iyolawa Shua, na Sofari iyolawa Naamati, watenda ka IMNDEWA pfayawalongele, na Imulungu kahulika chayalombile Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />Ayubu hayawalombele sale tsake, baho Imulungu kamuyitsila ingekewa iyakalile nayo aho mwanduso, na kamwing'a Ayubu mala mbili kubita aghala ghayakalile nagho mwanduso. <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />Kuya ndughu tsake wamale, na lumbu tsake, na sale tsake, na chila munu iyamanyile aho mwanduso, waghenda ukaye yake, waja naye. Wamwonela libatsi na wamkanza kwa ghamaghayo ghose IMNDEWA ghayamghalile, na chila munu kamwing'a ipete ya fetsa na ya nzahabu.<verse eid="JOB 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />Lelo mna imiyaka yake ikalile, IIMNDEWA kambaliki ghendo Ayubu kubita ahala mwanduso, tsakana ng'olo elufu kumi na nne, na ngamiya elufu sita, na ng'ombe elufu mbili, na pfihongwe pinga elufu imwe. <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />Pfipfila tsakana wana wamale saba na mapinga wadatu. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />Imwanaghe pinga wa mwanduso kamkema Yemima, wakeli kamkema Kezia, na wakadatu kamkema Kereni Hapuki. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />Mna isi yose ng'akukalile mapinga wanoghile ka neghe tsake Ayubu, na aba wawo kawagholela tsimali hamwe na lumbu tsawo iwamale. <verse eid="JOB 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />Haghamalile agho, Ayubu kakala mgima miyaka miya na alubaini, kawona iwanaghe, iwatsukulu, na pfilembwe pfake pfose mbaka mweleko ghwake ghwakane. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />Apfo kafa akuno kalala ghendo, kakala miyaka mingi.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>